<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Johan</book>
  <para style="h">Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Achil in thu a um a, thu khu Pasian kungah aum hi, thu khu Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Achiil in Ama Pasian toh a um khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sil zousie Ama tungtawn a siem ahia, silsiem chinteng Ama lou a kisiem bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ah hinna a um a, tua hinna khu mihingte vahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vah khu miel lah ah ahing vah a, miel in tua khu athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasiana kipat a sawl mi khat a um a amin Johan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam mipa khu theipitu ding in ahing pei a, tua vah thu ama zieh a mi zousie’n atahsan theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama pen vah khu ahisih a, hinanleh tua vah theipi ding a sawl ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuakhu vah dihtah, michin leitunga hing pei pouma salvahpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama leitung ah a um a, leitung Ama siem ahia, tualeh leitungin Ama athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama amite kung ah ahing pei a, Ama amiten akipahpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama kipahpi poumate kungah Pasian tate hitheina ding hamphatna apie hi, Ama min gingtate kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua mite pen sisan a pieng ahisih ua, tahsa deidana pieng zong ahisih ua, tualeh mihing deidan a pieng zong ahi dieh sih ua, hinanleh Pasian a pieng ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh thu khu tahsa ahing suoh a, i lah uah a um a, (Pa tapa tang nei sun thupi bangin athupina imu uhi) hepina leh thutah in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Johan in Ama theipina apie a akikou a, “Ka nua a hing peipa’n Kei ahing makhelta hi, Kei masanga um mawng ahi ziehin, chia atungtang thu ka genpa khu Ama ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama bukimna itang chiet ua, hepina tungah hepina sawn sawn toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen dan thu Mosi tungtawna pieh ahia, hepina leh thutah pen Jesu Khrist tungtawn a hing um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koiman bangmachihin Pasian amungai sih. Pa angsunga um Tapa tang nei sun in Ama tanchin aphuongkheta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judaten Jerusalem a kipat in siempute leh Levimite Johan kungah, “Koina hiei?” chia dong ding a asawl lai ua, tambang theipina thu ana gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman nielse louin agenkhie a, “Kei Khrist ka hi loupi” chi’n akiphuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amauten “Ahileh koina hiei? Elijah na ma leh?” chi’n adong uhi. Aman ka hi sih achia, “Guolnei na hiei leh?” achi ua, Aman “Ka hi sih” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akung ah, “Koi na hiei? Kou hing sawlte ka dawn theina ding un hing hil in. Nang leh nang koi kichi na hiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman guolnei Isai genbang a, “Mangpa lampi siel tang un chi a, gamdai a Kikoupa aw khu kahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ami sawlte u’pen Pharisaite lah a mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaun, “Khrist lah hilou, Elijah lah hilou, tualeh guolnei lah hilou, na hileh bang ding a na baptis ahiei?” chiin adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Johan in amauh adawnga, “Ken tuiin ka baptis a hinanleh na theilou uh mi khat na lah uah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama ahi kanua a, hing pei ahing makhel dingpa, Kei pen akedap khau sut taah zong ka hisih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam silte pen Jordan gal a Bethabara a, Johan in abaptis na mun a kibawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azingni’n Johan in Jesu ama lam zuon a hing pei amu a, “En un, Pasian belamnou leitung khelna lamangpa khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka nua a hing peipa, Kei um masanga umsa mawng ahizieh in, Kei sanga thupizaw ahi chia ka genpa khu tam mipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ken Ama kana thei sih hi, hinanleh Israelte kunga suhlat ahi theina dingin tui a baptis in ka hing pei ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Johan in athu atheipi a, Hagau vakhu banga van a kipat a hing kumsuh a atunga tuong den ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ken Ama kana thei sih a, hinanleh tui a baptis ding a hing sawlpa, Ama mama in ka kungah, koi hitaleh Hagau hing kumsuh a atunga tuongden na mu penpa khu, Ama ahi, Hagau siengthou a baptis ding pa khu, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua khu ka muta a, tualeh tampa khu Pasian tapa ahi chi ka theipi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Azing nikia in Johan anuazuite ni toh ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu avah lai a en a, “En un, Pasian belamnou” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua nuazui nite’n athugen aza ua, Jesu azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu akihei a, ahingzui uh amu a, akung uah, “Bang ahiei na sui uh?” achi hi. Amaun akungah “Rabbi (tua khu Siepa china ahi) hei a um na hiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Hing pei unlen, En un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaute ahing pei ua, a umna ava mu uhi. Tualeh nitah lam nai li vel ahitah ziehin tua ni akungah ataamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Johan thugen za a, Jesu zuitegel lah a khat khu Simon Peter sanggampa Andru ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aman amasapen in ama sanggampa ngel Simon ava mudoh a, akungah “Messiah Ka muta uh,” achi hi. (Messiah pen Khrist china ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh aman Jesu kungah Simon ahing zawpi a, Jesu’n ama a en a, “Nang pen Jonah Tapa Simon na hi a, Kephas ahing kichita ding hi” tua khu suong china ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Azingni in Jesu Galili gam ah pei asawm a, Philip amu a, akungah, “Hing zui in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Philip khu Andru leh Peter tenna khuo Bethsaida a teng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Philip in Nathanael amu a, akungah, “Mosi in dan laibu sunga atungtang thu ana gelpa guolneiten zong ana gel uh Nazareth Jesu Joseph tapa khu ka muta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nathanael in akungah, “Nazareth akipat in sil hoi apawtkhe ngai amah” achi hi. Philip in akungah “Hing pei inlen hing en in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesu’n Nathanael Ama kunglam zuon a hing pei amu tahin, ama tungthu ana gen a, “En un, Israel mi dihtah lepchie ngailoupa ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nathanael in akungah, “Kei bang nahing chi thei ahiei?” achi hi. Jesu’n adawng a akungah, “Philip in nang ahing hat masang a theipi phung nuoi a na um laiin, ka hing muta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nathanael in adawnga, akungah, “Rabbi, Nang Pasian Tapa na hia, Israel te leengpa na hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akungah, “Theipi kung nuoi ah ka hing muta ka hing chi zieh a, na hing gintat amah? Tam silte sanga thupizaw na hing mu nalai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akungah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, Tunua chiengin, Van kihong na mu dinga, Pasian vansawlsiengte Mihing Tapa tunga kaltou leh kumsuh na mu ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ani thum niin, Galili gam a Kana khuo ah kitenna khat a um a, khunah Jesu nu zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu leh anuazuite zong kitenna ah chiel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh uoin ahing bei tahin, Jesu nu’n akungah “Uoin anei nawn sih uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, numei nang awlmawna toh kei bang kisai kha ahiei? Ka hun atung nai sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anu in tuonvaite kungah, Aman na kung ua “Agen pouma bawl un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judate tawndan ngaina dungzui a, tui a kisiensuona dinga kizang suongtuibel litar sawmgiet ahiei, zaleh sawmni ahiei, dawl chiet guh atung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Tuibelte ah tui sungdim un,” achi a, tuachi’n amaun belgong gei chiet in asung dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Themkhat sawhkhie unlen, pawi nehbawl tuonvai lamkaipa kungah vatawi un,” achi hi. Amaun ava tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawi nehbawl tuonvai lamkaipa’n tua tui uoin hing suoh khu achiem a, hei a kipata hing umdoh ahiei chi atheisih a, (ahivangin tuonvai tuisawkheten athei uhi) Pawi nehbawl tuonvai lamkaipa’n mouneipa ahan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akungah, “Michin in akipat chil in uoin chiate ahawm masa a, michielten akham nua chieng ua, achia loudeute ahawm uhia, nang lah tu dongin achia na nei na lailai a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami chiemtena lamdang kipatna Jesu’n Galili gam a Kana khuo a abawl ahia; tualeh athupina akilang sah hi, anuazuiten Ama agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami nuain Kapernaum khuo ah Jesu anu toh, asanggamte toh, tualeh anuazuite toh apei suh ua, khunah ni tam ataam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Judate peikan pawi anaita a, Jesu Jerusalem ah apeitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh biehinn huong sunga bawng leh belam leh vakhu zuate tualeh dawkan a sum hengmi toute amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman jepna khauhuol abawl zouin biehinn huongsung akipat in, belamte leh bawngte abawn in a notdoh sienga, tualeh sumheng mite dangka abuohkhup pieh a, adawkante uh a sawnpua pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman vakhu zuate kungah, “Tam silte tana pat in lamang un, Ka Pa inn summet bawlna inn in bawl sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuiten, “Na inn a dinga ka phattuom ngainain ahing ne tumta chi a David gel ahing theidoh uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten adawng ua, akungah, “Tam silte na bawl ngal leh koute lah a chiemtena bang ahiei na hing lah thei ding?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga “Tam biehinn susie un, ni thum sungin ka tungding ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten, “Tami biehinn lamna in kum sawmli leh guh alut a, nang maw ni thum sunga na tun ding kia ding?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahivang in Aman atahsa pumpi biehinn agenna ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin mishi lah akipat a athawkia nuain anuazuiten tam akung ua athugente ahing thei thata ua, Pasian Laisiengthou leh Jesu thugen agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Peikan annkuonglui lai a Jesu Jerusalema a um laiin, chiemtena lamdang abawlte amu un mi tampiten amin agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n mizousie atheichien ziehin amaute lah ah akikaang koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Aman mihing sunga um athei ziehin, mihing thu koima hilchet akiphamaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharisaite lah a mi, amin Nikodem kichi Judate vaihawmpa khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama zanlai in Jesu kungah ahing haw a, akungah “Rabbi, Pasian akipat a hing pei Siepa na hi chi ka thei uhi. Pasian umpilou mi koima’n na chiemtena lamdang bawlte abawl thei sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu’n adawng a akungah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, mi koipou apientha sih leh Pasian gam amu sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nikodem in akungah, “Mi ateh nuain bangchin apiengtha thei diei? anu sunga nivei lut in apieng thei diei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, Mi koipou tui leh Hagau a, apientha sihleh Pasian gam alut thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahsa a pieng pouma tahsa ahia, Hagau a pieng pouma Hagau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pientha ngeingei ding ahi, na kunga kachi lamdang sa sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hui a utna lamlam ah alaang a aging na za hi, hinanleh heia hing kipan a, heilang a pei ding ahiei chi na thei sih hi. Michin Hagau a pieng pouma tuabang ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nikodem in adawnga, akungah, “Tam silte bangchi’n ahithei diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu’n adawng a, akungah, “Israelte Siepa khat hinapi a, tam silte theilou na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Adihtahin ka hinghil ahi, kouten ka thei uh ka gen ua, ka mu uh ka theisah uhi; ahivangin nouten koute theipina thu na pom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitung silte ka hing hil nangawn tahsang utlou na hi u’leh, vanlam silte hing hil leng bang na chi tahsan ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Van a kipat a hing kumsuh, Mihing Tapa van a um chiloungal koima van ah akaltou nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in gamdai a gul akhaikang bangin Mihing Tapa zong khaikangin aum ngeigei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koipou Ama gingtain mangthai lou a, kumtawn hinna anei zawhna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in khovel a it sengsenga, tuachi’n a tapa tangkhat neisun apie hi, koipou Ama gingta in amanthat lou a kumtawn hinna anei zawhna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khovel siemlou tangsah dingin Pasian in atapa leitungah asawl sih a, Khovel Ama vanga hundam ahitheina dingin asawl zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama gingta pouma siemmaw tansahin aum sih a, hinanleh agingta lou pouma siemmaw tansah zou ahita, Pasian Tapa tangkhat neisun min agintat lou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua khu siemlou tanna ahi, vah leitungah ahing pei a, hinanleh miten vah sangin miel adei zaw uhi, asilbawlte uh agitlou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Koipou sil gilou bawl in vah a huo uhi, tualeh vah ah zong ahing pei ut sih uhi; tuachilouin asil bawlte uh akilang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh koipou sildih bawl khu vah ah ahing pei ua, asil bawlte uh Pasian a bawl ahi chi akilat theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam silte nuain Jesu anua zuite toh Judia gamah ahing pei ua, khunah amautoh a umkhawm a abaptis zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Johan in zong khuna tui atam ziehin Salim kunga Aenon ah abaptis a, tualeh amaute a hing pei ua, baptisma atang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Johan suongkul ah akikhum nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Johan nuazuite leh Judate kikaal ah kisiensuona thu ah kinielna ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaute Johan kungah ahing pei ua, akungah “Rabbi Jordan gal a na kunga um atanchin na theipipa’n baptis abawl a, akungah mizousie ahing pei uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Johan in adawnga akung uah, “Van akipat a pieh ahisihleh mihingin bangma anei thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei Khrist khu ka hisih a, amasang a sawl ka hi zaw hi chi noute mama in na hing theipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mouneipa khu mou pasal ahia, hinanleh mouneipa lawmpa akung a dinga, athu ngaikhieh khu mouneipa aw ziehin alung nuom mama a, Tuaziehin tam ka lungnopna abukimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aman khanlam anaw dinga, Ken kiemlam ka naw ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tunglam a kipat a hing peipa khu mi zousie tung a ahi a, lei a pieng khu leimi ahia, leilam sil mama agen hi; van akipat a hing peipa khu mi zousie tunga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman amu leh azahte a theipi a, koiman a thu theipina thu apom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Koipou athu theipina pom in Pasian a dih ahi chiin apom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian misawlpa’n Pasian thu agen a; Pasian in lah a kungah Hagau tedetdet in ape sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pa in tapa a it a, akhut ah sil zousie apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Koipou tapa gingta in kumtawn hinna aneita, koipou tapa gingta louin hinna amu sih ding a, hinanleh Pasian thangpaina atungah a um den ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu’n Johan sangin nuazui tamzaw asiema abaptis hi chi Pharisaiten aza uh chi Mangpa’n atheitah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Ahivang in Jesu hiel in a baptis sih a anua zuiten abaptis uh ahi zaw hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judia gam anuasie a, Galili gamah apei kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Samaria gam tawn malam a apei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samaria khopi khat Saikar achi uh, Jakob in atapa Joseph kunga mun apiehna kung ahing tungta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khunah Jakob tuikul aum a, Jesu zong akhuolzin lampeina agim ziehin tuikul geiah atou a, tua khu sunkim laitah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samaria numei khat tuitawi dingin ahing pei a, Jesu’n akungah “Dawn ding hing pe vawi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anuazuite lah khopi lam ah neh ding leiin apei siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samaria numei in akungah, “Bangchidan a nang Juda mi in Kei Samaria numei kunga dawn ding na hing nget ahiei?” Judaten lah Samaria mite bangma a na ngai lou uh hilou ahieimah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu’n a dawnga akungah, “Pasian silpieh leh na kunga dawn ding hing piein chipa koi ahiei chi theilachin nang akunga ngen zaw ding hima ve chin, Aman tuihing hing pe ding hiven,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei in akungah, “Pu aw asawhna ding bangma na nei sih a, tuikul lah athuh mama in, hei a kipata tua tuihing la ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pu uh Jakob sanga thupi zaw na hiei mah? Aman tami tuikul ahing pie a, tualeh ama ngelin zong adawn a, atate leh aganhonten zong a dawn uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, akungah, “Koipou tami tui dawn pouma adangtah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh ken akunga ka pieh ding tui dawn pouma bangchih tanin adangtah nawn sih ding uhi. Akunga ka pieh ding tui khu ama ah tuinah ahing hi ding a, kumtawn hinna phain akikhotou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Numeinu’n akungah “Pu aw, Ka dangtah kia nawnlou na dingin leh tui tawi dinga tana ka hing kuon nawn louna dingin tua tui khu hing peve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah: “Pei inlen na pasal va han inlen tanah hing pei kia in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu’n adawnga, “Pasal ka nei sih” achi hi. Jesu’n akungah, “Pasal ka nei sih na chi, na chidih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Atahtah in Pasal nga na neita a, tulai tah a na nei zong na pasal ahi sih hi, na thugen adih ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numeinu’n akungah, “Pu aw guolnei khat na hi chi ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate un tami muol tungah Pasian abie ua, hinanleh nouten Jerusalem vateh a miten Pasian abieh ding uh ahi” nachi sese uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah “Numei aw, hing gingtain, tam muol tung sese lou ah zong, Jerusalem sese lou ah zong Pa na bieh hun uh hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nouten na theilou uh na bie uhi, Kouten ka bieh uh ka thei uhi; aziehpen hundamna Judate a hing kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh ahun tung ding ahita, tu’n zong atung ahita, tua hun chiengin abe tahtahten Pa khu Hagau leh thutahin abe ding uhi, aziehpen Pa in tuabang mi Ama be ding in asui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasian khu Hagau ahia, abe miten Hagau leh thutah a abieh ding uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numeinu’n akungah, “Khrist kichi Messiah ahing pei ding chi ka thei hi; Ama ahing pei chieng in bangkim ahing hil ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Kei na kunga thugenpa khu Ama ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hunlai tahin anuazuite ahing tung ua, numeinu akihoupi lamdang asa mama ua; hinanleh koiman “Bang ahiei na dei?” “Bangding a numeinu toh kihou na hiei?” achi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu in atuibel anuasie a, khopi lam ah apei a, mite kung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hing pei unlen hing En un, ka sil bawlsate zousie hing hil mi khat a um hi. Khrist hilou ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute khopi apat apawtdoh ua, akungah ahing peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuakaal in anuazuiten “Rabbi ann ne phot in” chiin asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akung uah, “Noute theilou ann neh ding ka nei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin anuazuite khat leh khat akihou ua, “Mi koi ahiei in a neh ding ahing tawipieh adiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Ka ann khu kei hing sawlpa deilam bawl leh Ama nasep zaw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nouten bu laah na ding hali avatna lai hi, na chi sih uh amah? Ngai un, ka hinghil ahi, Dahkhie unlen, loute en un, laah hun in amin siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bulapain thaman amu a, kumtawn hinna tana um ding ga alakhawm a; atu pa leh a atpa akipah khawm theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khat in atu a adangin aga a at zel chi thu tanah adih ngel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na sepgim louna uh ga at dingin ka hing sawl ahi. Midangten ana semgimta uh a, nouten asepgimna uh na sutzop uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua numei in, “Aman ka silbawlsa zousie ahing hil hi” chi theipina thu agen ziehin tua khopi a, Samarimite tampi in Jesu agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samarimite Jesu kung ahing tun un akung ua taam tadi dingin ahou ua, khunah ni ni atamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Ama thugen ziehin midang tampi in agintat belap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amauten numeinu kungah, “Tuin vang nang thugen zieh a gingta ka hinawn sih ua, kouma mamain ka za ua tualeh tampa pen leitung hundampa, Khrist ahi chi ka thei uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh ni ni nuain khuna kipat in apawt a, Galili gam ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama Jesu ngel in guolnei ama gam lam ah pahtawi in a um ngai sih chi atheisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n Galili gam ahing tun tahin, Galili miten Ama ana kipahpi uhi. Amaute Jerusalem khuo a peikan annkuongluina a, va haw ahizieh un asil bawl zousie ava mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu khu tui uoin asuohsahna Galili gam a Kana khuo ahing tung kia hi. Khunah mi thupi khat, atapa Kapernaum khuo ah china in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama’n Judia gam a pat Galili gam ah Jesu ahing tung chi azahtah in, akung ah ahing pei a, tualeh vapeisuh a atapa va sudam dingin angen vanguo hi, aziehpen ama ashi, dihdih ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah “Chiemtena leh sil lamdang na mu sih u’leh na gingta sih ding uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mithupipa’n “Pu aw, Ka tapa ashi masangin hing hawsuh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Peita’n na tapa adamta hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amapa’n Jesu’n akunga athugen agingta a, apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama lampi a apeisuh laiin asuohten atapa adamta chi thu toh ana dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ahing dampat lai hun adonga amaun akungah, “Zani nai sagi in a chithuo in ama anuasieta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n apain tua khu Jesu’n akunga “Na tapa adamta” achi hun laitah ahi chi atheita hi; tualeh ama leh a innkuonpi tengin agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tam pen Judia gam a pat Galili gam ahing tun nua a, chiemtena lamdang Jesu’n abawl ni veina ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami nuain Judate pawi khat a um a, Jesu Jerusalem ah ahawtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem ah belam kotpi kungah dil khat a uma, Hebrew ham in Bethsaida kichi innhim nga nei a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua inn himte ah damloute, mittote kengbaite tualeh zengte tampi tuikiloh ngah in alum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen bangchihun ahiei khat chiengin vansawlsieng khat dil ah apeisuh a, tui ava sau zel hi, tuachi’n koipou tui kisau nua a lut masa pen pen khu bangchibang natna neinanleh suhdam in a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khunah mi pasal koi ahiei khat kum sawmthum leh kum giet damlouin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama khuna lum Jesu’n amutah in tambanga hun sawtpi um ahita chi athei a, akungah “Suhdam na ut ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Damloupa’n “Pu, tui kisau chienga dil a hing koi ding mi ka nei sih a, Keima a ka pei chieng in, midangin ahing makhel zel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah “Thou inlen, na netpha la inlen, na kengin in peita in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua mipa thakhat in adam pai a, anetpha ala a, kengin a peita hi. Tuani khu khawlni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin Judaten suhdam a umpa kungah, “Khawlni ahia, na netpha na puoh dan ahi sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman amaute adawng a, “Ahing sudampa ngelngel in ka kungah, na netpha la inlen, peita in, ahing chi hi” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akung ah “Na netpha la inlen, na kengin peita in hing chipa koi ahiei?” chi’n adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh damsaha um pa’n, ama damsahpa koi ahiei chi athei sih hi; aziehpen tua mun a mipi umte lah akipat in ana kigelmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuami nuain Jesu’n Pasian biehinn ah ama amu a, akungah, “En vawi, suhdamin na umta hi khielkia nawn sin, tuachilouin sil sezawsem na tungah ahing tung kha ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua mipa apawtkhie a, asudampa khu Jesu ahi chi Judate ava hilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte ziehin Judaten Jesu abawlsie ua, tha a sawmta uhi; tam silte khawlni a abawl ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n amauh adawnga, “Ka Pa’n tutan dong ana asem a, ken zong ka sem hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin Judaten Jesu tha atum semsem ua, Aman khawlni abawsiet guoh hilouin, Pasian ka pa ahi achi a, Pasian toh kibang a akibawl zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga, akung uah, “Noute thutah ka hing hil ahi, Tapa in ama thuin bangma abawl thei sih hi. Pa in abawl amute loungal, aziehpen Aman abawl pouma tuate khu Tapa in zong abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Pain Tapa a it a, asilbawl zousie akungah amusah leng hi, tualeh lamdang na sah dinguh tamte sanga nasep thupizaw amusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pa in mishite akaithou a, ahinsah mabangin, Tapa in zong adeisahte kungah hinna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pain koima tungthu akhen pieh sih a, thukhenna zousie Tapa kungah apekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pa azatat bang ua mi zousie’n Tapa zong azatat theina dinguh ahi. Tapa zatat lou in, Pa Ama sawlpa zong a zatat sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Noute thutah ka hing hil ahi, Koipou ka thu za a ahing sawlpa gingta in kumtawn hinna aneita; thukhenna ah alut nawn sih ding a, shina apat hinna ah a lut zawta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Noute thutah ka hing hil ahi; Mishite’n Pasian Tapa aw azahna ding uh hun hing tung ding ahita, tuin zong atung ahita hi, tualeh aza pouma ahing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen Pain Ama a hinna akinei bangin Tapa in zong ama a hinna akineina dingin a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Mihing Tapa ahizieh in thukhen vaihawmna thuneina zong a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam silte lamdang sa sih un, aziehpen ahun tung ding ahita; khum hun chiengin hankhuh sunga um zousiein a aw aza ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh ahing thoudoh ding ua, silhoi bawlte khu kumtawn hinna tangin athou ding ua, tualeh sil gilou bawlte khu siemlou tangin athou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ken ka thuin bangma ka bawl thei sih, ka zah bangin thu ka khen zel a, ka thukhen adih ahi. Aziehpen keima deilam bawl louin, Pa, kei hing sawlpa deilam ka bawl zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keima leh keima kitheipi hitaleng, ka thu theipi adih sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kei hing theipi midang khat a um hi, tualeh aman ahing theipina thu adih ahi chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nouten Johan kungah mi na sawl ua, ama’n thutah tanchin atheipita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh mihing akipat theipina ka pom ka china ahi sih a, ahivangin hundam a na um theina ding un, tam silte ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Johan pen meivah kuongpha leh taangpha tah ahi a, tualeh noute ama vah ah tomkhat nopsah na ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanleh Johan a sanga theipina lien zaw ka nei hi; Pa’n ka sep zou ding ahing pieh ka nasepte mama in, Pain Kei ahing sawl ahi chi ahing theipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Pa kei hing sawlpa ngel in zong ka tanchin ahing theipi hi. Nouten bangmachihin a aw na za ngai sih ua, a mel zong na mu ngaisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh athu na lung sung uah na vom sih uhi; Ama ahing sawlpa na gintat lou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Laisiengthou na hoisim ngel uhi, aziehpen asunga kumtawn hinna nei in na kingaituo uhi, tuate khu keima tanchin theisahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh hinna na neina dingun ka kungah na hing pei nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ken mihingte pahtawina ka pom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten Pasian itna na lungsung uah na nei sih uhi, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kei ka Pa min in ka hing pei a, noute’n na hing kipahpi sih uhi. Midang khat Ama min in hing pei leh na kipahpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Noute, khat leh khat kipahtawi tuona ngaina a, Pasian khat bou akipat a hing pawt pahtawina sui loute’n bangchin na gingta thei ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Pa kunga noute hing heh dingin hing ngaituo sih un; noute hing hehpa khat a um hi, ama khu na gintat uh Mosi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aziehpen Mosi ana gingta hita u’lachin kei zong na hing gingta ding uhi, aziehpen aman ka tungthu ana giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten a thugelte na gintat sih uleh bangchi’n ka thute na gingta thei ding uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nuain Jesu Galili tuipi, Tiberia zong kichi gal lamah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman chinate tunga asil lamdang bawlte amu ziehun mipi tampiin Ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu muol tungah akaltou a, tuanah anuazuite toh a tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Judate peikan pawi hun a naita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu adah a, mi tampi akung lam zuon a hing pei amu in Philip kungah, “Tam mite neh ding tanghou hei a lei ding ihiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’n tam pen Philip ze etna ding a agen ahia, aziehpen Aman bang ahiei abawl ding atheisa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philip in “Michin in themkhat chiet a atan ding u’zong makhai zani man tanghou kiching nailou ding hi,” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anuazuite lah a khat, Simon Peter sanggampa Andru in akungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tanah naupang khat barli bu tanghou tun nga leh nga neu nou ni nei a um hi; ahivangin mi hizapi lah a dingin bangtham ahi diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n “Mipite tousah un” achi hi. Tua mun ah loupa tampi a pou a, mipite loupa tungah atou ua, atam lam uh tul nga vel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n tanghoute ala a, kipah thu agen zouin, nuazuite kungah ahawm a, anuazuiten mipi toute kungah ahawm uhi, tuabangmain Ngate zong adeikhop chiet uh ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n khamtaha aneh nua un, Aman anuazuite kungah, “Bangma amanthai louna dingin khamval nengthemte luoh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin aluohkhawm ua, barli bu tanghou tun nga nete khamval nente, aluoh uh seu sawm leh ni adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu sillamdang bawl amu un tua mipiten, Tam mipa leitunga guolnei hing pei dingpa ahi tahtah hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n amauh hing pei a thatang hat a Ama man a kumpipa a bawl ding ahi uh chi athei tahin, Amatangin muol tung lam ah akihemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh nitah lam ahing hitahin anuazuite tuipi lam ah a peisuh ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kuong khat ah atuong ua, Kapernaum lam zuon in tui tungah apeita uhi. Tualeh khuo a mielta a Jesu lah akung uah ahing pei nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huipi hattah ahing laan ziehin tuihuol sangpipi in akijawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n tai thum ahiei, tai li ahiei, a jep nua un Jesu tui tunga akenga pei a, kuong lam hing zuon in amu ua, azau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akung uah, “Keima ka hi, zau sih un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun thanuom tahin kuong sung ah a tuongsah ua, tualeh kuong khu azotna gam uh atung paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azing ni’n tuipi gallang khat a ding mipiten anuazuite tuonna loungal kuong dang a um sih chi leh Jesu anuazuite toh kuongah atuong sih a, anuazuite amauh ngenin apeita uh chi amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahivang in Tiberia tuipi akipat in, Mangpa’n kipahthu agen zou a tanghou anehna mun kung ah kuong dang ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipiten tua mun ah Jesu hileh a nuazuite hileh a um nawn sih uh chi athei tahun, ama u’zong kuong neute ah atuong ua, Jesu sui in Kapernaum khuo ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaute’n tuipi gal lang khatlam a Ama amu tah un, akungah, “Rabbi bangchih a tana tung na hiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Noute thutah ka hing hil ahi. Sillamdangte na mu zieh ua hing sui na hi sih ua, hinanleh tanghou na ne ua na gilva zieh ua na hing sui uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ann mangthang sui in phiephie sih unlen, Mihing Tapa in ahing pieh ding kumtawn hinna donga umden ding ann sui in phe zaw un. Pa Pasian in Ama tungah chiemtena a akoita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Pasian nna ka sep theina ding un, bang ahiei ka bawl ding uh?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Pasian nasep khu tami ahi: Ama mi sawlpa gintat khu,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun Akung ah, “Ahileh ka mu ua ka hing gintat theina dingun bang chiemtena na hing ensah diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate un gamdai gamgaw mun ah manna ane uh; Aman van akipat in neh ding tanghou apie, chia kigiel bangin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Adihtah in ka hing hil ahi, Mosi in tua tanghou van a kipat in ahing pe sih a, hinanleh ka Pain Van a kipat in tanghou dihtah ahing pe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian tanghou khu van a kipat a hing kumsuh leitung kunga hinna pepa khu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaun akungah, “Mangpa tam tanghou khu koute hing pe ngitnget in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Kei hinna tanghou khu ka hi, koipou ka kunga hing pei agilkiel ngai sih dinga, tualeh koipou kei hing gingta khu adangta ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, Nouten kei hing muta napi in zong na hing gingta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka pa’n kei ahing pieh zousie ka kungah ahing pei ding, tualeh ka kunga hing pei pouma ka notdoh vawt sih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aziehpen Keima deilam bawl dinga van apata hing peisuh ka hi sih a, ahing sawlpa deilam bawl dinga hing peisuh ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Pa kei hing sawlpa deilam khu tami ahi. Aman ahing pieh zousie khatbeh mansuo lou a, hinanleh ni tawp ni chienga kaithou zaw ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh tam khu ahing sawlpa deilam ahi, koipou Tapa mu a gingta in kumtawn hinna anei a, tualeh ken ni tawpni chienga ama ka kaithaw khu ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate atungah aphun ua, “Kei van a kipat a Tanghou hing kumsuh ka hi” achi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amauten “Tam mipa Jesu Joseph tapa hilou amah? Anu leh apa zong ithei uh hilou amah? Van a kipat a hing kumsuh ka hi bangchi dan a achi ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu’n adawnga, a kung uah “Phun phun sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pa kei hing sawlpa’n ahiip sihleh koima ka kungah ahing pei thei sih hi, tualeh Ken ama ni tawpni chiengin ka kaithou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Guolneite laibu ah: Pasian in amaute zousie ahil sieng ding, chi gel ahi. Tuaziehin michin Pa thu za a, thei pouma ka kungah ahing pei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mi koima’n Pa amu ngai sih, Pasian a kipat a hing peipa loungal in, Ama’n Pa amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, koipou kei hing gingtain kumtawn hinna aneita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kei hinna tanghou khu ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na pu na pate un gamdai ah manna ane ua, hinanleh a shi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tami van a kipat a hing kumsuh mi’n aneh a a shi louna ding uh khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kei van a kipat a tanghou hing, hing kumsuh khu ka hi, mi koiin zong tam tanghou aneh leh kumtawnin ahing ding uh, tualeh ka tanghou pieh ding khu leitung pumpi hinna dinga ka pieh ding ka tahsa ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuaziehin Judate akiniel ua, “Bangchidan a tam Mipa’n atahsa neh dinga pe thei ding ahiei,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, Mihing Tapa tahsa na neh ua, tualeh asisan na dawn lou u’leh nouma ah hinna na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Koipou ka tahsa ne a, tualeh ka sisan dawn in kumtawn hinna aneita; tualeh ken ama khu ni tawpni chiengin ka kaithou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Aziehpen ka tahsa khu neh ding ann ahi a, ahi tahpi a; tualeh ka sisan zong dawn ding tahpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Koizong ka tahsa ne a, Ka sisan dawn khu Keima ah a um zing a, tualeh kei ama ah ka um zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Pa hingin kei ahing sawl bangin Pa zieha ka hin bangin, tuaziehin koi zong kei hing ne pouma keima zal in ahing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tami vanna kipat a hing kumsuh tanghou hing khu ahi; na pu na pate un manna ane ua, ashi bang uh ahisih, koizong tami tanghou ne pouma khu kumtawn in ahing ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tam thute khu Jesu’n Kapernaum kikhopna inn a athuhil lai a agen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuaziehin anuazuite tampi in tam thu azah tahun, “Tampen thu hasa ahi, koiin atheisiem mawh diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thu ah anuazuite aphun uh chi alungsima athei tahin, akung uah, “Tam thuin noute ahing sulung nopmaw amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Mihing Tapa tu masang a aumna a kaltou mu u’lachin bang na suohta ding uoi le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hinna pie khu Hagau ahi, tahsa pen bangma aphatuom sih, na kung ua ka thugente Hagau ahi a, tualeh Hinna zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Hinanleh na lah uah gingtalou lawikhat na um uhi,” achi hi. Aziehpen Jesu’n achiil akipat a, agingtaloute leh Ama mansah dingpa atheisa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Aman tuaziehin ahi, “Ka Pa’n phalna apieh sih leh koima ka kungah ahing pei thei sih hi, chia na kung ua ka gen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tua hun a kipat in anuazuite tampi anua peita ua, Ama azui nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n sawm leh nite kungah, “Noute zong na peimang ding uh amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Simon Peter in adawnga akungah, “Mangpa koi kungah ka pei ding uoi? Nangma’n kumtawn hinna thute na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nang Pasian hing Tapa Khrist khu na hi chi ka gingta ua, thei zong ka thei uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Jesu’n amauh adawnga, “Ken nou sawm leh nite ka hing tel hilou na hi uoi mah? Na lah ua mi khat dawimangpa ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Ama’n Simon tapa, Juda Iskariot thu agenna ahi; ama zong sawmlenite laha tel hinapi Jesu lebawl a mansah dingpa khu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nuain Jesu Galili gam sung ah avah kawikawi a; Judate’n tha atup ziehun Judia gam apha nuom ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judate hampheng pawi ahing naita a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin asanggamten akungah, “Tana pat in Judia gam ah pei in, na nuazuiten silbawlte amu theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi koizong zapi theiding a ut leh aguh in sil abawl ngai sih hi. Tam silte na bawl ngal leh leitung pumpi kungah kimusah in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen asanggamte nangawn in zong ama agingta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Ka hun atung nai sih hi, hinanleh noute hun pen bangchih laipou a mansa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute leitung pumpi in ahing muda thei sih a, Kei pen ahing muda uhi: asilbawl giloute uh ka theisah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Noute pawi bawlna ah va haw un, Kei pen ka hun atun nailou zieh in tami pawi ah ka haw nai sih ding hi. Ka hun atun bukim nailou zieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam thute agen nua in, Ama Galili gam ah atam nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh asanggamte pawi bawlna ahawtou nua un, Ama zong koima theilouin aguh in ava hawtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n pawi bawlna mun ah Judaten Ama asui ua, “Hei a um ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Ama tungtangah mipite lah phunna nasatah a umta a; kimkhat in, “Mihoi ahi” achi ua, Midangten “Hoivanhou mipi solgawp ahibou hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Judate agiin zieh un koiman langtang tahin agen ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh annkuonglui san laitah in Pasian biehinn ah apeitou a, thu ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judaten lamdang asa ua; “Tam mipa’n zilna neiloupi a bangchidan a lai ahichi thei a hiei?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu’n amaute adawnga, “Ka thuhilte keima a hing kipan ahi sih a, ahing sawlpa a hing kipan ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi koipou in Ama deilam bawl ding a utlam ahileh ka thuhilna khu Pasian a kipat ahiei ahisihleh Keima thuneina toh ka gen ahiei, chi athei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koipou ama phuohthu thugen pouma ama thupina ding sui ahia, hinanleh Koipou a sawlpa thupina sui mi khu mi dih ahi a, ama ah dihtatlouna mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosi in noute dan ahing pie hilou ahiei mah? Hinanleh koima’n dan na zui sih uhi. Bangdinga tha dinga hing sui na hi uoi?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipite’n adawng ua, “Dawi lawm nei na hive, koi ahiei nang hing tha sawm?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu’n amaute adawnga, “Sil khat ka bawl a na bawn un lamdang nasa chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mosi in teptan thu ahing pie a, Mosi pieh ahi sih a, na pu napate ua hing kipan ahizaw hi. Tualeh khawlni in mi tep na tan pieh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nouten khawlni a mi tep tan pieh uchin a, Mosi dan botsie na hi tuon sih u’leh, ken khawlni a mi khat ka damsiengsah zieh a bangding a lungthah na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Akilatdan bangin thu khen sih unlen, dihtat tahin thu khen zaw un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem akipat mi pawlkhat in, “Tam mipa hilou ahiei mah tha dinga asui uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh En un, Aman lah hangsan tahin thu akigen a, amaun lah akungah bangma agen sih uhi. Ama khu Khrist ahi chi vaihawmten athei tahtah uh adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahivang in eiten lah Tam mipa hei a hing kipan ahiei chi ithei ngal ua, hinanleh Khrist ahing pei chiengin, Ahing kipatna koima’n athei sih ding,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n biehinn sunga a thu hil laiin ahing kikoukhie a, “Nouten kei na hing thei ua, kang kipatna zong na thei uhi; Keima thu a hing pei ka hi sih a, hinanleh Kei hing sawlpa adih ahi. Nouten Ama na thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh ken Ama ka thei hi; aziehpen Ama a pat a hing pei ka hia, tualeh Ama hing sawl ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama mat a tum ua, hinanleh ahun atun nailou ziehin koiman atungah khut aha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh mipi tampi in Ama agingta ua, “Khrist ahing pei chiengin, Tam mipa bawl sanga tamzaw sillamdang abawl tuom diei izaw?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tambanga mipite kidaphou a aphunna uh Pharisaiten aza ua, tualeh Pharisaite leh siempu liente’n Ama man dingin biehinn veng galkapte asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Noute kungah hun tomkhat ka um dinga, tuazou chiengin ahing sawlpa kungah ka pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nouten na hing sui ding ua, na hing mu sih ding uhi, tualeh ka umna ah zong na hing pei thei sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Judate khat leh khat akihou ua, “I mu lou dinga hei langa pei ding adiei? Greekte lah a kithethang imite lah a va pei a, Greekte thu vahil ding adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na hing sui ding ua, na hing mu sih ding uh, tualeh ka umna ah noute na hing pei thei sih ding uh, achi khu bang achina adiei?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Annzalui ni nukhia pen leh thupi pen niin, Jesu adingtou a, akikoukhie a, “Mi koizong adangtah leh ka kungah hing pei henlen, dawn heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Koizong kei hing gingta pouma, Laisiengthou gen bangin, asunga kipat in tui hing luite aluongkhe ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thu khu Ama gingtaten amu ding uh Hagau Siengthou agenna ahia, aziehpen Hagau Siengthou pieh ahi nai sih hi, Jesu pahtawi a aum nailou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin mipite lah a tampite’n tam thu azah tah un, “Tam mipa guolnei tahtah ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Midangte’n lah “Ama Khrist ahi,” achi uhi, hinanleh pawlkhat in “Khrist Galili gam ah ahing pieng diei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Laisiengthou in Khrist khu David hahlesuon a kipat leh David tenna khuo Bethlehema kipat in hing pieng ding ahi, achi hilou amah? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama ziehin mipite lah ah kikhenna a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua pawlkhat in Jesu mat atumta ua, hinanleh koiman atungah khut aha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n biehinn veng galkap lamkaite, khu siempute leh Pharisaite kungah ahing pei ua, tualeh amaun akung uah, “Bangdinga Ama hing zawpilou?” ana chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Biehinn veng galkap lamkaiten, adawng ua, “Tam mipa thugen bangin koiman thu a gen ngai mawngmawng sih,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharisaiten “Noute zong sol a um na hita uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Vaihawm pawlte leh Pharisaite lah ah, Ama gingta a um khata uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hinanleh dan theilou tam mipite pen hamse thuoh ahi uh,” achi ua, adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nikodem Janlai a Jesu kunga va hawpa alah ua mi khat a hia, aman akung uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“I dan un mi ama kam a thu zah masah leh asilbawlte thei masah masangin siemlou atangsah ngai amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amaun adawng ua, akungah, “Nang zong Galili mi na maw leh? Sui inlen, envawi in, Galili gam ah guolnei mawngmawng apieng ngai sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n michin a inn chiet uah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu Olive muol ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingmawng matah in biehinn ah ahing pei kia a, mi zousie akungah ahing pei ua, tualeh ama atou a, amauh thu ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigielmite leh Pharisaiten numei khat angkawmlai amat uh, akungah ahing zawpi ua, alaikim tah uah ading sah ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kungah “Siepa, tam numei a angkawm laitah a kiman ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dan laibu ah Mosi in tambang mi khu suonga selup ding thu ahing pie hi. Hinanleh Nang bangchi ding na chi ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam pen Ama hehna ding amu theina ding ua, aze etna ua agen uh ahi. Hinanleh Jesu akunsuh a, amaute thugen zalou bangin akhutme in lei lah agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabanga a doh mun seng zieh un, Ahing dahtou a, akung uah, “Na lah ua khelna neilou pen in amanu sep masa heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Akunsuh kia a leilah agiel kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun tam thu azah un, asie leh pha theina un mawpai in, a upa pen a kipat atawp dongin khat khat in apei mang ta ua, Jesu leh alai a ding numeinu maimai anuasieta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu adahdoh tahin, “Numeinu chilou midang koima amuta sih a, akungah, Numei nang hing hehte heia umta uh ahiei? Koiman siemlou hing tangsah lou hi maw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amanu’n “Mangpa koiman siemlou ang tangsah sih,” achi hi. Jesu’n akungah “Ken zong siemlou ka hing tangsah sih hi, pei inlen khiel kia nawn sin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung uah “Kei leitung vah ka hi; kei hing zui pouma miel ah akhohei sih dinga, hinna vah anei zaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pharisaiten akungah, “Nang leh Nang kitheipi na hi bou hi. Na theipina thu adih sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Kei leh kei kitheipina thu gen hitaleng zong, ka theipina thu adih ahi, aziehpen heisunga hing kipan a heilang pei ding ka hiei chi ka thei hi. Hinanleh nouten ka hing kipatna na thei sih ua, heilang a pei ding ka hiei chi zong na thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nouten tahsa dan in vai na hawm ua, Ken koima tungah vai ka hawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaihawm pieh na hita leng zong ka vaihawm adih hi; aziehpen kei ngentang ka hi sih a, Kei leh ka Pa ahing sawlpa ka hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na dan laibu sung uah zong, mi ni thutheipi khu adih ahi, chi akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei pen keima thutheipi khat ka hi a, tualeh Pa ahing sawlpa’n ka thu ahing theipi ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Na Pa hei a um ahiei?” achi uhi. Jesu’n adawnga, “Nouten kei lah nang thei sih ua, ka pa zong na thei sih uhi; Kei hing thei u’lachin ka Pa zong theita ding hi ve u’chin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam thute Jesu’n biehinn huongsunga sillatte koikhawmna mun a athuhil laia agen ahi, tualeh koiman atungah khut aha sih uhi, ahun atun nailou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah agen kia a, “Ka peimang ding a nouten na hing sui ding ua, na khelna uah na shi ding ua, Ka peina ah na hing pei thei sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten “Ama leh Ama kithat ding adiei, ka peina ah na hing pei thei sih ding uh achi ziehin?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Noute pen nuoi lam a kipan na hi ua, Keipen tunglam a kipan ka hi; Noute tam leitunga na hi ua, Keipen tam leitunga ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kung uah, Na khelna uah na shi ding uh, aziehpen Kei ama ka hi chi na gintat sih u’leh, na khelna uah na shi ding uh, ka chi ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Nang koi na hiei?” achi uhi. Jesu’n akung uah, “Achiil a na kung ua ka gen mama khu ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tungtang thu uah gen ding leh vaihawmna ding tampi ka nei hi; hinanleh ahing sawlpa pen adih ahi, Ama apata ka zahte leitung mi zousie kungah ka gen zel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman Pa thu amaute kunga agen ahi chi athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Mihing Tapa na khaikang zou chiengun, Kei ama ka hi chi leh. Keima thuin bangma ka bawl sih a, hinanleh ka Pa’n ahing hil bangin tam thute ka gen zaw ahi, chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama kei hing sawlpa ka kung ah a um hi. Pain Kei ngentangin ahing nuasie sih hi, Ama kipahnalam silte ka bawl ngitnget ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam thute agen lai in mi tampi in Ama agingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n Ama gingta Judate kungah, “Ka thu a na um zing u’leh ka nuazuite na hi tahtah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh thutah na thei ding ua, tua thutah in noute ahing suohtasah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaun adawng ua, “Koute Abraham hahlesuonte ka hi ua, koima suoh leh sal in ka taang ngai sih uhi; bangchidan a noute suotatsah na hi ding uh, na hingchi ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n amauh adawnga, “Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, Koizong khelna bawl pouma khelna suoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Suoh pen kumtawnin inn ah a umden sih a, hinanleh tapa pen kumtawn in a umden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaziehin Tapa in ahing suotatsah leh na suohta tahtah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Abraham hahlesuonte na hi uh chi ka hing thei hi; hinanleh nouten kei tha na hing tum uhi, ka thu nouma lungsim a a umlou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ken ka Pa kunga ka mute ka gen a, nouten na pa uh kunga na mute uh na bawl uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amauten adawng ua akungah, “Abraham ka Pa uh ahi,” achi uhi. Jesu’n akung uah “Abraham tate hi u’lachin Abraham nasepte na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh tu in Kei Pasian kunga kipata ka zah thutah hing hilpa tha na hing tum uhi. Abraham in tambangin abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nouten na pa uh silbawlte na bawl uh ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Koute zawlta ka hi sih uhi. Pa khat ka nei uh, tuakhu Pasian,” ahi achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Pasian na Pa uh hileh kei na hing itta ding uhi, aziehpen Pasian a kipat a hing pei ka hi a, Keima thu a hing pei ka hi sih a, Ama sawl ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bangchidan a ka thugen theisiemlou na hi uoi? Ka thugen na pom theilou zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Noute na pa uh dawimangpa a na hi ua, na pa uh deilam na bawl uhi. Ama khu achiil a kipata tuolthatpa ahia, ama thutah ah aumlou ziehin thutah ah ading sih hi. Zuou agen lezong ama a um khu agen ahia, aziehpen ama zuoutheipa ahia, tualeh zuouna pa zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Thutah ka gen ziehin nouten na hing gingta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na lah uah koi ahiei khelna thu a siemlou hing tangsah? Thutah ka gen leh bangdinga hing gingta lou na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pasian a kipan mi in, Pasian thute angaikhie hi. Tuaziehin Pasian a kipat na hi lou zieh un, Ama thu na ngaikhe nuom sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten a dawng ua akungah, “Nang Samari mi na hi a, dawi zawl na hi ka hing chi uh, ka chi dih mama uh hilou ahiei amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga “Kei dawi zawl ka hi sih a, Ka Pa ka pahtawi ahi zaw, nouten kei na hing pahtawi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ken keima thupina ka sui sih a, vaihawmna sui mi khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, mi koipouin ka thu azui leh shina achiem kha ngai sih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten akungah, “Tuinvang dawi zawl na hi chi ka hing theita uh, Abraham ashita a, guolneite zong ashita uh, hinanleh Nang, mi’n ka thu azui leh shina achiem kha ngai sih ding na chi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ashisa ka pu uh Abraham sangin Nang na thupi zaw amah? Guolneite lah ashita uh; Nang leh nang koi a hing kibawl na hiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesu’n “Kei leh Kei kipahtawi hitaleng, ka kipah tawina bangma ahi sih ding, ahing pahtawi khu ka Pa, nouten Ka Pasian uh ahi na chipa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten Ama na thei sih ua, ken Ama ka thei hi. Ama ka thei sih chileng noute banga mi zuou ka hita ding hi, hinanleh Ama ka thei tahtah a, athu zong ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na pu uh Abraham in ka ni mu ding anuom mama a, amuta ngei a, akipah mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten akungah, “Nang kum sawmnga zong ching nailouin Abraham na mu khata amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, Abraham um masangin ka umta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten asena dingin suong ala ua, hinanleh Jesu akiphuol a, biehinn a pat apawtkhie a, alah ua peisuoh in apeita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu lampi a apei laiin, apien apat mitto khat amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anuazuiten akungah, “Siepa tam mipa mittosa a apien, koi khelna ahiei? Ama khiel ahiei, ahisihleh anu leh apa’n?” chiin adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Tam mipa lah akhiel sih a, anu leh apa’n zong akhiel sih uhi, hinanleh Pasian nasepte ama tunga akilat na dinga tam sil tung ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sun ahilaiin Ama kei hing sawlpa na ka sep ngeingei ding ahi; zan hing tung ding ahita, khum hun chiengin koima’n na asem thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitunga ka um sungteng, leitung adingin vah ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam silte agen zouin, lei ah achil asie a, achil in tungman abawl a, tua tungmanin mitto pa mitte anu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mittopa kungah, “Pei inlen Siloam dil ah vasil in” achi hi. (Siloam khu sawl china ahi.) Tuachi’n apei a avasilta a, mitvah in ahing kilekiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin a innvengte leh masang lai a amittot lai na musaten, “Tam mipa khutdaw a touzelpa hilou amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawlkhatte’n “Ama ahina hi” achi ua, pawl dangten “Hilaizang sih akisutpi hibou” achi uhi, hinanleh amapa’n, “Kei ama ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun akungah, “Na mitte bang hing chi vah ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman adawnga, “Jesu kichi mi khat in tungman abawl a ka mitte ahing nu pieh a, ka kungah Siloam dil ah pei inlen vasil in, ahingchi a, tuachi’n ka pei a, ka sil a, tuachi’n ka mu thei ta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Ama hei ah a um ei “achi ua; Aman “Ka thei sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaun masang lai a mittopa khu Pharisaite kungah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu’n tungman abawla amit avahsah ni khu khawlni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharisaiten zong amitte hing vah dan akungah adong kia uhi. Aman akung uah, “Ka mit ah tungman anu a, ka vasil a, tuachi’n ka muta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pharisaite Pawlkhat in, “Tam mipa Pasian a pat a hing kipan ahi sih, aziehpen khawlni atang sih hi,” achi uhi. Midangte’n “Bangchidan in mi khiel in tambang sillamdang abawl thei diei?” achi ua, tuachi’n alah uah kikhenna a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaun mittopa kungah, “Na mit hing vahsahpa tungtang ah nang Ama bangchi mi hiva” na chi ei? Nang mit hiven avahsah, achi uhi. Aman “Guolnei hiva,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Judaten amit hing vahpa nu leh pa ahat masangsie uh, tua mipa mittosa a pieng ahia, tu a khuo hing muthei ahi, chi atungtang thu agingta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh amaun anule pa kungah, “Tam mipa na tapa uh mittosa a pieng na chipa uh ahi nai mah? Bangchidan a tua hing mu theita ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anu leh paten amauh adawng ua, “Tam mipa ka tapa uh ahi a, mittosa a pieng ahi chi ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh bangchidan a tu a khuo hing muthei ahiei, ahisihleh koi ahiei amit suhvahpieh chivang ka thei sih uhi. Ama dongun, mi piching ahita, ama tungthu kigen thei ahita,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mittopa nulepaten tambanga thu agen u’khu Judate agiin zieh uh ahi; aziehpen koizong Ama Khrist ahi chi a gen pouma kikhopna inn apata nawdoh ding ahi chiin Judaten kithukimna khat aneisa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin ahi anulepate’n mi piching ahita, “Ama dongun,” achi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten mittopa khu ahan kia ua, akungah, “Thupina Pasian pie in, kouten tam mipa mikhiel ahi chi ka thei uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman adawnga, “Mikhiel ahileh hilou ka thei sih, sil khat ka thei hi, mitto kana hi a, tuin ka mu theita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Aman na tunga bang ahiei abawl? Na mit bang ahing chi suhvahpieh ahiei?” achi kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman “Ka hing hil zouta hi, na ngai nuom sih uhi. Bangdinga na zah ut kia uh ahiei? Nou zong anuazui hi na ut uh amah?” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama aphawh ua, “Nang Ama nuazui na hi a, Koute pen Mosi nuazui ka hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasian in Mosi kungah, thu agen chi ka thei uh, Tam mipa ahileh hei a hing kipan a hing pei ahiei chi ka thei sih uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amapa’n adawnga, akung uah, “Tami ahi vele alamdanna! Hei a hing kipan ahiei na theilou uh, hinapi a, Aman lah ka mit ahing suhvah pieh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasian in mikhielte thu angaikhe sih chi ithei uhi, hinanleh mi koizong Pasian bieh ngaisah a adeilam bawl mi khu angaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leitung pien chiil akipat in mittosa a pieng mitte akisuhvah pieh chi koiman aza ngai sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam mipa. Pasian a hing kipan hisih leh bangma abawl thei sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaun adawng ua, akungah, “Nang khelna bukim apieng in koute na hing hil ngam viel maw?” achi ua; ama anotdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu’n tua mipa anotdoh uh chi aza a, tualeh ama amu tahin, akungah, “Pasian Tapa na gingta ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aman adawnga akungah, “Mangpa Ama koi ahiei? Ka gintat theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Ama na muta a, nang hing houpipa ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuabepin aman “Mangpa ka gingta hi,” achi a, Ama abeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Mu theilouten ahing mutheina ding u’leh, mitvahte mit ahing tawt theina dinga vaihawm dingin leitunga hing pei ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Akunga um Pharisai pawlkhatten tam thute azah tahun, akungah, “Koute zong mitto ka hi uoi mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Mitto hi u’lachin khelna neilou ding hi ve uchin, hinanleh tuin mu thei na kichi ua, tuaziehin na khelna uh a umden hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, koipou kotpi a lut lou a lam tuom a kal a belam huonga lut khu guta leh suomhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh koipou kotpi alut khu belampu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama khu kotpi vengpa’n ana honpieh a, belamten a aw aza uhi, tualeh aman abelam khu amin un ahan a, amauh apuidoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n abelamte apuidoh chiengin amasang uah apei a, belamten anua azui uhi; a aw athei zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh midang pen azui sih ding ua, ataimangsan zaw ding uh, aziehpen mi dang aw aza thei sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu’n tambang gentena thu zangin thu ahem gen a, hinanleh amaun akung ua bang thu ahiei agen atheisiem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah agenkia a, “Chitahtahin na kung uah ka gen ahi, kei belam kotpi khu ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka masanga hing pei zousie khu gutate leh suomhatte ahi uh, hinanleh belamten athu uh angai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei kotpi khu ka hi, Koipou keima a alut leh hundam in a um dinga, tualeh lut in apawt dinga, neh ding amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Guta khu gu ding leh that ding leh suse ding loungal in ahing pei sih, Kei pen amaun hinna anei na ding u’leh, kiningching tah a aneina ding ua hing pei ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei belamchingpa hoi ka hi, belampu hoiin belamte dingin ahinna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh nehthalaw, belamchingpa dihtah hilou, belamte ama a hilou mi in, ngie hing pei amu chiengin belamte anuasie a ataisan leng hi, tualeh ngiein belamte aman a adelzah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nehthalaw ahiziehin belamte awlmawna anei sih a, ataimangsan zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei belamchingpa hoi ka hi, Ka belamte ka thei a, ka belamten kei ang thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pain kei ahing thei bangin, Ken zong Pa ka thei hi, tualeh belamte a dingin ka hinna ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh tam belam huong a hilou, belam dang zong ka nei hi, amauh zong ka hing pui dinga, ka aw aza ding uhi; tuachi’n belamchingpa toh hon khat in aum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka Pain Kei ahing it hi, lah kia dinga ka hinna ka pieh zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koiman ka hinna ahing lahpieh ahi sih a, keima thu a ka pieh ahi zaw hi. Pieh theina leh lahkia theina thuneina ka nei hi. Tam thupieh ka pa apat ka mu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam thute ziehin Judate lah ah kikhenna a um kia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua tampi in “Dawi lawm ahi, amo ahi, Bangdinga athu na ngaikhieh uh ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adangten, “Tam thute dawi lawm nei mi thugen ahi sih, dawi in mittote mitte avah sah thei amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem a kipumpiehna pawi hun lai ahia, Phalbi lai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu khu biehinn huong Solomon innliep ah aviel vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Judate akim ah ahing kikhawm ua, akungah, “Bangtan vei lungnawngkai a hing koi ding na hiei? Khrist na hileh, chientahin hing hil in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu’n amauh adawnga, “Ka hing hilta a, na tahsang sih uhi; Ka Pa min a ka sil lamdang bawlte’n ka khantan ahing theipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh na kung ua ka gen tah mabangin ka belamte na hilou ziehun na gingta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka belamte’n ka aw aza ua, ken amauh ka thei hi, tualeh amaun ahing zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh ken kumtawn hinna ka pie hi; kumtawnin amangthai sih ding ua, koiman ka khut apat ahing lahpieh thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka pa amauh hing pepa mi zousie sangin athupizaw hi; Koima’n ka Pa khut apat ahing lahpieh zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kei leh Ka Pa khat ka hi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate’n asena dingin suong ala kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Ken ka Pa akipat nasep hoi tampi noute ka hing musahta hi. Tuate laha hei pen zieh a, suonga hing se sawm na hi uoi?” achi a, adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judaten adawng ua, “Nasep hoi ziehin suonga se ka hing tum sih ua, hinanleh Pasian na gensiet zieh leh Nang mihing hi ngal a, Pasian banga na kibawl zieh ahi zaw hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Na dan laibu sung uah, noute pasiente na hi uh ka hing chi hi, chi akigiel asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pasian thu tunnate nangawn pasiente na hi uh chi ahileh, Laisiengthou thu lah suhsiet ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ken Pasian tapa ka hi kachi zieh a, Pain asuh siengthou a, leitunga a Sawlpa tunga Pasian gensie na hing chi uh ahi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa nate semlou ka hileh hing gingta sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh ana ka sep ahileh, kei hing gingta sih nan u’lachin zong, na kisemte beh gingta un, Pa keima ah a um a, Kei Ama ah ka um chi na thei ua, na gintat theina ding un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama mat atum kia ua, hinanleh akhut ua pat asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Johan in achiil a baptisma abawlna mun Jordan gal ah apei kiata a, khunah ava umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi tampi akungah ahing pei ua, “Johan in sillamdang bangma bawl anei sih a, hinanleh Tam mipa tungtang Johan in agen zousie adih kim hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh khunah mi tampi in Ama agingta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lazar kichi mi khat achi ana hi. Ama Mari leh asanggamnu Martha tenna Bethani khuo mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asanggampa Lazar china nu khu Mangpa thaunamtui nu asam a akeng siapiehnu Mari khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin asanggamnuten Jesu kungah, “Mangpa Ngai vawi, na itpa achi ana hi,” chiin mi asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu’n tua thu azah tahin, “Tam natna pen shina khop hiel ahisih a, hinanleh Tami zieh a Pasian Tapa’n pahtawina atan theina dinga, Pasian thupina ding ahi zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu’n Martha leh asanggamnu leh Lazar a it a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lazar chinat azah nuain ni ni dang a um na ah ataam nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuazouin anuazuite kungah, “Judia gam ah pei kia vai” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuazuiten akungah, “Siepa masang zepin Judaten suongin ahing se sawm ua, nang khuna haw sawm kia na hiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga “Sun hun sungin naikal sawm leh ni a um hilou ahiei mah? Mi koizong suntang lai a avah chiengin akisuipua ngai sih a leitung vannuoi vah amu zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koizong zanlai a avah chiengin akisuipua leng uhi, ama a vah aumlou ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman tam thute agen a tua zouin akung uah, “I lawmpa uh Lazar a imuta, ama phawng dingin ka va pei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuiten “Mangpa imu ahileh hing dam kia nava maw?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amabou Jesu’n ashi thu agenna ahi a, amaun imu a khawldam agenna hiva chiin angaisut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, chientah in agen a “Lazar ashita, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na gintat theina ding ua, khuna ka umkhah lou, noute ziehin ka kipah hi. Hinanleh akungah va haw vai,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Thomas Didum kichipain anuazuipite kungah, “Eite zong Ama toh ishikhawm theina dingun vahaw va ui,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu ahing tun in Lazar hankhuh sung ah ni li ana umta chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethani khuo pen Jerusalem khuo kung nai a um Kilometer thum vel a gamla ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judate tampi Martha leh Mari kungah, asanggampa uh shina tunga henem dingin ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Martha khu Jesu ahing pei chi azah tahin ava pei a, Jesu ava lamdawn a, hinanleh Mari pen innsungah atou nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Martha in Jesu kungah, “Mangpa tana um hilachin ka sanggampa shilou ma ding hiven,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin zong Pasian kunga na nget pouma Pasian in ahing pe ding, chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu’n amanu kungah, “Na sanggampa athoukia ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Martha in akungah, “Ni tawpni chienga thawkiana ah athoukia ding chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Kei thawkiana leh hinna ka hi, koizong kei hing gingta khu shinanleh ahing ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh koipou hing a hing gingta pouma ashi ngai nawn sih ding hi, tami na gingta ei,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amanu’n akungah, “Hina, Mangpa Nang Khrist, Pasian Tapa, leitunga hing pei dingpa khu na hi chi ka gingta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amanu’n tamte agen zouin apei a, asanggamnu Mari aguhin ahan a, “Siepa ahing tunga, nang ahing han hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mari in tam thu azah tahin kintah in adingdoh a, Jesu kungah ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu pen khosung ahing lut nai sih a, Martha in ava lamdotna mun ah a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate, inn sunga amanu henem a, amanu toh umten, Mari kintah a dingdoh a pawtdoh amu un anua azui ua, han a kap dinga va pei ding hiva achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mari Jesu umna mun ahing tunga Jesu amu tahin akengbul ah apuasuh a, akungah “Mangpa, Tana um hilachin ka sanggampa shilou ding hima ven,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jesu’n Mari kap leh ama toh hing zawhkhawm Judate kap a um amuin lungsim in athum a, tualeh amangbang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh “Ama hei ah na siel uoi?” achi hi. Amauten akungah, “Mangpa hing pei inlen en in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu a kapta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate’n “En vawi ua, it hina va-ia!” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pawlkhat in “Tam mittopa mitte vahsahpa’n Lazar zong shilou a koi theilou adiei,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu alungsim a thum kawm in han ah ahing pei a, han khu kokhuh ahia, han kot khu suonga kisin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu’n “Asuong hemkhie un,” achi hi. Mishipa sanggamnu Martha in, akungah, “Mangpa tuin vang uita va, ashina ni li aphata hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesu’n amanu kungah, “Na gintat a ahileh Pasian thupina na mu ding, na kungah ka chisih amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun han kotkhana suong ahemkhie ua, tualeh Jesu avandah a, “Pa aw ka thu na ngaikhieh ziehin ka kipah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh na hing ngaikhe ngitnget chi zong ka thei hi, hinanleh ka kiim a ding mipite ziehin tami ka gen ahi, Nangman na hing sawl ahi chi agintat theina ding un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, Aw ngaitahin akikoukhie a, “Lazar hing pawtdohin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n mishi khu akhut akeng han puon a kituomsa in ahing pawtdoh a, amai zong puon in akituom hi. Jesu’n amaute kungah “Phel unlen pei sah un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mari kunga hing haw a Jesu sillamdang bawl mu Judate tampi in Jesu agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hinanleh pawlkhatte Pharisaite kungah apei ua, Jesu silbawlte ava hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu liente leh Pharisaite’n vaihawmte ahankhawm ua; “Bang ilawta diei? Tam mipa’n sillamdang tampi abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tambanga ihazan u’leh mi zousiein, Ama agingta ding ua, tualeh Romemite ahing pei ding ua, igam leh inamte ahing lahpieh ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tualeh amaute lah a mi khat, tuami kum a siempu lien Kaiapha achipa un akung uah, “Bangma thei sih uteh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Inam pumpi amanthai louna dinga mipi taang a mi khat ashi eite dingin ahoizaw chi zong na ngaituo sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tami aman ama phuothu agen ahisih a, tua kum a siempu lien ahi a, Juda namte tanga Jesu ashi ding agenlawhna ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh tua namte bep hilouin, Pasian ta kithethangte zousie pawlkhat a apuikhawm theina ding zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua ni akipat in Ama tha ding dan ngaituo in akihou zingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu Judate lah ah alangtangin avah nawn sih a, tuana kipat in gamdai nai lam ah Ephraim kichi khopi khat ah apei a, tuanah anuazuite toh a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tualeh Judate peikan pawi ahing naita a, tuami masanga kisiensuo dingin mi tampite gam sung lam a kipat in Jerusalem ah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Jesu asui ua, biehinn huong sungah ding kawm in akihou ua, “Bangchin na ngaisut uoi? Peikan pawi a hing hawlou ding adiei?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Siempu liente leh Pharisaiten mi koizong a umna thei aumleh Ama amat theina ding ua, amaute hil pai dingin thupieh khat ana bawl zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n peikan pawi na ding ni guh masangin, shina akipata akaithawpa Lazar tenna Bethani khuo ah, Jesu ahing haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuanah Ama a dingin nitah ann abawl ua, Martha in ann apie a, Lazar pen Ama toh annkuong impite lah a khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mari in Spikenard thau namtui man tamtah buh khat ahing tawi a, Jesu kengphang anu a asamin anawtpieh hi. Tua sathau namtui in inn sung pumpi azel suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuite lah a khat, Ama man sah dingpa Simon tapa Juda Iskariot in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Bangdinga tami sathau gimnamtui makhai za thum a zua a mi zawngte kunga kipe lou ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman mi zawngte akhotuo zieha tam thu agen ahisih a, ama guta ahia, dangka ip akem a, asung a kikoite alahdoh zel zieh a agen ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n “Amanu subuoi da un, amanu’n tami ka kivui ni a dinga akoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zawngte pen na kung ua um ngitnget ding ahi uh, hinanleh kei pen noute kunga ka um ngitnget sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate tampi in Jesu tuanah aum chi atheita ua, Jesu zieh bep hilouin shina apat akaithaw Lazar zong amu nuom ziehun, ahing pei khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh siempu lienten Lazar zong atha theina ding dan uh akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Lazar ziehin Judate tampi in amaute nuasie in Jesu agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azing ni in annzaluina a hing pei mi tampi in, Jesu Jerusalem a hing haw ding ahi chi ana za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n tum nate atawi ua, Ama lamdawn dingin apawtdoh ua, “Hosanna! Mangpa min a hing pei, Israel kumpipa, ahampha hi,” chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n sabiltung nou khat amu a atungah atuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zion tanu aw zau sin, En vawi, na kumpipa, sabiltungnou tunga tuongin ahing pei hi,” chia kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam silte achiil in nuazuiten atheisiem sih uhi; hinanleh Jesu pahtawi a aum nua in, tam thute Ama tungtanga kigiel ahi a, tualeh atunga tam silte abawl uh ahi, chi ahing theidohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin han a pat Lazar ahatdoh leh shina akipata akaithaw lai a akunga umten a thu atheipita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam thute ziehin mipiten zong, tam chiemtena sillamdang abawl chi azah ziehun, Ama ana lamdot uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pharisaite akihou ua, “En un! bangma na law thei sih uhi chi na mu uoi? En un leitung pumpiin Ama azuita” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh annzaluina a hing hawte lah ah Greekmi koite ahiei a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaute khu Galili gam a Bethsaida khuo a um Philip kungah ahing haw ua, “Pu Jesu ka mu nuom uhi” chiin ahing ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Philip apei a Andru ava hil a, tualeh Philip leh Andru in Jesu ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu’n amauh adawnga, “Mihing Tapa pahtawi a a umna ding hun atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chitahtahin na kung uah ka gen ahi, Butang khat lei a akieh a, ashi sih leh, ama tangin a umden a hinanleh ashi chiengin ga tampi ahing suong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Koipou ahinna it in ataan dinga, tualeh koipou tam leitunga ahinna huoin kumtawn hinna dongin ahumbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koipouin ka nna asep leh hing zui heh, tualeh ka umna ah ka nasempa zong a um ding hi. Mi koipou in ka nna asep leh ka Pain ama akipahpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tuin ka lunggim mama hi, bang ahiei ka gen ding? Pa aw tambang hun akipat hing hundam in, chi ding ka diei? Hinanleh tami ding zieh a tam hun ahing pei ka hi thuoi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa na min pahtawi in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n van apat in aw khat ahing ginga, “Ka pahtawita, ka pahtawi kia ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaziehin akunga dinga, tua thu zaten van ging ahi, achi ua, adangten lah “Vansawlsiengten Ama ahoupi ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Tam aw pen kei dinga hing ging ahi sih a, noute a dinga hing ging ahizaw hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu khu tam leitung vaihawm hun ahi a, tuin tam leitung vaihawmpa paikhiet ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh kei leitung apat khaikanga ka um chiengin mi zousie keima lam ah ka hip ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam pen Aman bangchibang shinain ahiei ashi ding chi theisahna a agen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipiten Ama adawng ua, “Khrist khu kumtawn a umden ahi, chiin Dan laibu sunga pat kouten ka za uhi, bangchidan a Nang, Mihing Tapa khaikanga um ding ahi, na chi ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n a kung uah, “Vah khu na lah uah hun tomkhat a um nalai ding hi. Vah na nei sungun kalsuon un, tuachilouin miel in ahing lap kha ding hi, koipou miel lah a vahin hei a pei ahiei chi a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vah na nei sungun vah khu gingta un, vah tate na hing hi theina dingun, achi hi. Jesu’n tam thute agen zouin apawt doh a, ama ua pat akibuta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute mitmu ah sillamdang tampi bawl nanleh Ama agingta tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tam pen guolnei Isai in ana genlawh atangtunna ding ahi Aman: “Mangpa ka thu tutte uh, koi ahiei gingta? Mangpa khut zong koi kungah ahiei akilat?” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaziehin agingta thei sih uhi aziehpen Isai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Aman a mitte uh atosah a, alungtangte uh a khausah hi; tuachilou in amitte un amu kha ding ua, tualeh alungtang ua theisiem in, Kei lam ah ahing kihei ding ua, ken kana sudam kha ding hi,” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tam thute pen Isai in Athupina amu lai a agen ahi a, tualeh a tungtang thu agenna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahivang in vaihawm lamkaite lah nangawn ah, mitampiin Ama agingta ua, hinanleh Pharisaite agiin ziehun, Ama agintatna uh agendoh ngam sih uhi, tuachilouin pen kikhopna inn apat in nawsuoin a um kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun Pasian patat a um sangin mihingte pahtat a um a dei zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu akikoukhie a “Koipou kei hing gingta khu, kei hing gingta ahisih a, Kei hing sawlpa gingta ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Koizong Kei hing mu khu ahing sawlpa mu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kei leitung vah dinga hing pei ka hi, koipou ahing gingta khu miel a aumden louna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi koiinzong ka thugente zain gingta sih nanleh ken ama mawsah dingin thu ka khen sih hi, aziehpen leitung thukhen a, mawsah dinga hing pei ka hisih a, leitung hundam dinga hing pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mi koiinzong kei hing nuol a, ka thugente apom sih leh, ama tunga thukhen ding khat anei hi, ka thugente mama in ni tawpni chiengin ama siemlou atangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aziehpen keima phuothuin thu ka gen sih a, hinanleh Pa kei hing sawlpa’n, ka gen ding leh ka hil ding thu ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Athupieh khu kumtawn hinna ahi chi ka thei hi; tuaziehin ka gen pouma khu Pa in ka kunga agen bangbanga ka gen ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Peikaan pawi akipat masangin, Jesu’n tam leitung nuasie a, Pa kunga apei hun atungta chi athei hi. Leitunga um ama ate a it a, atawp dongin a amauh a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nitah ann aneh lai un dawimangpa’n Simon tapa Juda Iskariot lungtangah Jesu matsah ding angaituosah zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu’n Pain sil zousie akhut ah apeta chi leh, Pasian akipat a hing pei a, Pasian kunga pei kia ding ahidan athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nitah ann ne lai adingdoh a, apuonsilte akoikhie a, kinawtna puon ala a, ateng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh kisilna kuonga tui asun zouin nuazuite keng asil pieh a, kinawtna puon atenin a nawt hul pieh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simon Peter kunga a hing pei tahin, Peter in akungah, “Mangpa Nang ka kengte sil talawm ding na mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, akungah, “Ka sil bawl tuin na thei sih, hinanleh tunua chiengin na hing thei ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Peter in akungah, “Nang ka kengte sil talawm lou e!” achi hi. Jesu’n adawnga “Ka hing sil sihleh kei kungah tan bangma na nei sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simon Peter in akungah, “Mangpa ka kengte guoh hilouin, ka khut leh ka lu zong sil in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Koipou akipumsilsa mi pen akengte loungal sil angai sih hi, hinanleh apum in asieng ahita, na unpi un vang na hi sih uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman Ama lebawl a mansah dingpa athei a, tuaziehin, “Na unpi un na sieng kim sih uh,” achi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachia akengte uh asil zouin, apuonsilte asil a, atou kia a, akung uah, “Na tung ua ka silbawl bang ahiei na thei uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nouten Kei pen Siepa leh Mangpa na hing chi ua, na chi dih ngel uhi, ahi ma ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachia kei na Mangpa u’leh Siepa un bawn na kengte uh hing silpieh ka hileh noute zong khat leh khat, keng na kisilpieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na tung ua ka bawl bangbang a na bawl na ding ua, etton ding ka hing pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, suoh khu apu sangin alienzaw sih a, tualeh sawl a umpa zong asawlpa sangin alien zaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam silte na thei ua na bawl u’leh mi hampha na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na unpi uh tungtangthu gen ka hi sih, ka telte ken ka thei hi, hinanleh ka annkuong impipa’n ka tungah aketul alehta chi Laisiengthou sunga kigiel a tangtun theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahun tun masangin tuin ka hing hil ahi, ahun tun chienga Ama ka hi chi na gintat theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noute thutah ka hing hil ahi, koi hinanleh ka mi sawl khat poupou na kipahpi khu, kei hing kipahpi ahi, tualeh koipou kei hing kipahpi in ahing sawlpa akipahpi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu’n tambanga agen zouin, alunggim mama a, “Noute thutah ka hing hil ahi, na lah ua khat in kei ahing mansah ding hi,” chiin atheisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anuazuite khat leh khat aki entuo ua, koipen gen adiei chi theilouin lamdang asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nuazuite lah a khat Jesu’n a itpa khu Jesu angah akingam phei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin Simon Peter in “Koi pen agenna ahiei chi dong dingin amitmei in ahoupi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Jesu anga kingam kawm in, “Mangpa koipen ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Tanghou them ka die zou a, ka pieh penpen ahi ding,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Aman tanghou them adie zouin Simon tapa Juda Iskariot apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tanghou them asan zouin, asungah Setan alutta hi. Jesu’n akungah, “Na bawl ding pen bawl meng in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh dawkan a toute koima in, bang zieh a tam thu akunga agen ahiei chi athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaute pawlkhat in, Juda in dangka ip akep zieh a Jesu’n akunga, “Annzaluina dinga kisam silte lei ding ahiei,” ahisihleh mizawngte kunga bang ahieikhat pe ding ahiei a asawl hiva chiin angaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Juda in tanghou them alah zouin apawtdoh pai hi. Tua hun khu zanlai ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda apawtdoh nuain, Jesu’n: “Tuin Mihing Tapa pahtawi in a umta, tualeh Pasian zong Ama vangin pahtawi in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama a Pasian pahtawi a aumleh, Pasian in zong Ama mama ah Tapa apahtawi dinga, apahtawi pai ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naute aw noute toh tomnoukhat sung um nalai ding ka hi, Nouten na hing sui ding ua, Judate kunga ka peina ah na hing pei thei sih ding uh, ka chi mabangin tuin noute kungah zong ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thupieh tha ka hing pie hi, noute khat leh khat ki ittuo chiet un, ken noute ka hing it bangin noute ki ittuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Noute khat leh khat na ki it tuo chiet uleh, ka nuazuite na hi uh chi miten ahing thei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon Peter in akungah, “Mangpa hei a pei ding na hiei?” chi’n a dong hi. Jesu’n adawnga “Ka peina dingah, tuin na hing zui thei nai sih ding, hinanleh tunua chiengin nang zui ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Peter in akungah, “Mangpa bangdinga tu a hing zui thei lou ding ka hiei? Nang dingin ka hinna ka pekhe ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesu’n ama adawnga, “Keima ziehin na hinna na phal ngel na diei? Chitahtahin na kung ah ka gen ahi, aa khuon masangin thum vei na hing kilepsan ding hi achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na lungtanguh mangbangsah sih un, Pasian gingta unlen, Kei zong hing gingta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pa inn ah umna tampi a um hi, a umlou hileh noute ka hing hilta ding hi. Nou a dinga mun bawla pei ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou a dinga mun bawl a ka vapei leh ka hing pei kia ding a, ka kung ah noute ka hing la ding hi; ka umna a noute zong na um theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka peina ding na thei ua, alampi zong na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thomas in akungah, “Mangpa na peina ding mun ka thei sih uhi, alampi bangchi’n ka thei ding uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Kei lampi leh thutah leh hinna ka hi, Keima a peilou in koima Pa kung ah atung ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nouten kei hing thei hi u’lachin, ka Pa zong na theita ding uhi; tu a kipat Ama na thei ua, mu zong na muta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philip in akungah, “Aw Mangpa, Pa khu koute hing musah in, tuachi’n ka lungkimta ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah “Philip aw, tamtanveipi na kung uah, ka uma hing thei naiva-ia lou na mah? Koipou kei hing muin, Pa amu ahi; bangchidan a Pa khu kou hing musahin na chi ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Pa ah ka um a, Pa keima ah a um chi gingta lou na hiei mah? Na kung ua ka thugente, keima thuin ka gen sih a, hinanleh Pa keima a um in tua nnate abawl ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei Pa ah ka um a, Pa keima ah a um, chi hing gingta un, ahisihleh silbawlte zieh beeh in hing gingta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, koipou kei hing gingta in ka nasepte aman zong asem ding hi; tualeh tamte sanga thupi zaw zong asem ding, ka pa kunga ka pei ding ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ka min a na nget pouma uh, tua khu ka bawl ding hi, Pa Tapa a pahtawi a aum theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka min a bang ahiei na nget pouma u’leh ka bawl zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kei na hing it u’leh ka thupiehte zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh ken Pa kungah ka ngen dinga, Aman noute toh kumtawn a umden ding panpitu dang khat ahing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuakhu Thutah Hagau ahi; leitungin Ama anei thei sih, aziehpen Ama amu sih ua, thei zong athei sih uh, ahivangin nouten Ama na thei uhi, aziehpen na kung uah a um a, na sung uah ateng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ken noute taga dingin ka hing nuasie sih ding, na kung uah ka hing pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun tomnoukhat nua chiengin leitungin kei ahing mu nawn sih ding; hinanleh nouten na hing mu ding uh; aziehpen kei ka hinga, noute zong na hing ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, Kei Pa ah ka um a, noute keima ah na um ua, Kei nouma ah ka um, chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Koipou ka thupiehte nei a, zui pouma kei hing it ahi uh, tualeh koipou kei hing it khu ka Pa’n a it ding a, ken ama ka it dinga, akungah ka kilaah ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Iskariot hilou pen Juda in akungah, “Mangpa koute kunga na kilaah a, leitung kunga na kilaah lou ding, bangchidan ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akungah, “Mi koipou in kei ahing it leh ka thu azui dinga, ka Pa’n ama a it dinga, Ama kungah ka hing pei ding ua, Ama toh ka teng khawmden ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Koipou kei hing it lou mi in, ka thugente azui sih a, na thu zahte uh keima a ahisih a, Pa kei hing sawlpa a ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Na kung ua ka um tahdi sungin, tam thute na kung uah ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Hamuonpa Hagau Siengthou, Pain ka min in ahing sawl ding a, aman sil zousie noute ahing hil ding hi, tualeh na kung ua ka thugensa zousie noute ahing theidohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hamuonna ka hing nuasie hi, Keima hamuonna ka hing pie hi, leitungin apieh bangin ken noute ka hing pe sih hi. Na lungtang uh mangbangsah sih unlen, zau zong zausah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka peimang dinga, na kung uah ka hing pei kia ding, chia na kung ua ka gen na zata uhi. Kei na hing it u’leh, Pa kungah ka pei ding ka chi ziehin na kipah ding uhi, aziehpen kei sangin ka Pa alienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahun tun masangin tuin ka hing hil ahita, ahun hing tun chienga na gintat theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukalsie na kung uah thu tampi ka gen nawn sih ding, aziehpen tam leitung vaihawmpa hing pei pai ding ahi; aman keima ah bangma anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken Pa ka it a, thu ahing pieh bangin ka bawl zel hi chi leitungin atheina ding un. Dingdoh un tana pat in ipeita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kei grepgui dihtah ka hi, ka Pa ahuon neipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima aum ba galou pouma apaimanga aga pouma asusiengthou zel hi, aga tam semna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute pen, na kung ua ka thugen ziehin asiengsa na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima ah um ngitnget un, Kei zong nouma ah ka um ngitnget ding hi. Bahieng pouma grepguia aum ngitnget sih leh amatangin aga thei lou mabangin, noute zong keima a na um sih u’leh na ga thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei grepgui khu ka hia, noute abahiengte na hi uh, Mi koipou keima a aum ngitnget leh, Kei ama a ka um ngitngetna pa’n ga tampi asuong zel hi. Aziehpen keima louin bangma na bawl thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi koipou keima a aum ngitnget sihleh bahieng banga paidoh in a um a, avuoi zel hi; mi’n tuabang bahiengte atomkhawm ua meiphuol ah apai ua, akatum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute Keima a na um ngitnget ua, ka thute nouma a, aum ngitnget leh na lunggul pouma uh ngen un, Nou a dingin bawl ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Noute na gaphat chiengun, tua khuin, Ka Pa apahtawi hi, tuachi’n ka nuazuite na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pain Kei ahing it bangin, Ken noute ka hing it hi, ka itna ah um ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nouten ka thupiehte na zui u’leh ka itna ah na um ngitnget ding uhi; Ken ka Pa thupiehte ka zui a, a itna a ka um ngitnget ma bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kipahna nouma a aum ngitnget theina ding leh, na kipahna uh abukim theina dingin tam thute na kung uah ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tami ka thupieh ahi: Ken noute ka hing it bangin noute khat leh khat ki ittuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi’n alawmte a dinga ahinna apieh sanga lienzaw itna a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thupiehte na zui u’leh ka lawmte na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Suohte ka hing chi nawn sih ding, aziehpen suohin apuin bang ahiei abawl athei sih hi; lawmte ka hing chi zawta ding, aziehpen ka Pa kunga ka zah zousie na kung uah ka hing theisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nouten kei na hing tel sih ua, Ken noute ka hing telzaw hi. Pei a va ga ding leh, na ga uh umden dingin, tualeh Ka min a Pa kunga na nget pouma uh ahing pieh theina dingin noute ka hing guot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamte ka hing thupieh ahi, noute khat leh khat ki ittuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Leitungin noute ahing muda leh noute ahing muda masangin Kei ahing muda zouta chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute leitunga hi u’lachin, leitungin ama ate a it ding hi. Hinanleh noute leitunga na hilou zieh un, leitunga kipat noute ka hing teldohta hi, tuaziehin leitungin noute ahing muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suoh apu sangin alienzaw sih chia na kung ua ka thugen thei ngitnget un. Amauten Kei ahing bawlsiet uleh, noute zong ahing bawlse ding uhi. Amauten ka thu zui uleh, noute thu zong azui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Ka min ziehin tam silte zousie na tung uah abawl ding uhi, Kei hing sawlpa atheilou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei hing pei lou a, akung ua thu genlou hi leng, khelna neilou ding hi ua, hinanleh tuin vang akhelna uah paulap ding aneita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Koipou Kei hing muda in ka Pa zong amuda uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Midang bawl ngailou silte alah ua bawllou hileng, khelna neilou ding hi ua, hinanleh tuin vang ka silbawlte amuta ua, Kei leh ka Pa ka ni un ahing muda uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh tampen, amauten azieh bei in ahing muda uh, chi adanbu ua kigiel thu atangtunna dinga hing um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Pa akipat na kung ua ka hing sawl ding, Hamuonpa, Pa akipat a hing pawt, thutah Hagau ahing tun chiengin, Aman ka tungtang thu atheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh nouten zong na theipi ding uhi, achiil a kipat a ka kunga um na hi ziehun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na kipalpua louna dingun tam thute na kung ua ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kikhopna innte akipat ahing notdoh ding ua, ahi, noute hing that pouma, Pasian nasem hoi a akingaituo hun uh, hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tam silte na tung uah abawl ding uhi, amaun Pa lah theilou, Kei lah hing theilou ahizieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh ahun ahing tun chienga, tam thute ka hing hilta chi na theidoh na ding ua, amauh tungtang ka hing hil masah ahi. “Na kung ua ka um nahlai ziehin, tam thute achiil in na kung uah ka gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh tu in Kei ahing sawlpa kunga pei ding ka hita, Koima’n hei a pei ding na hiei? chiin na hing dong sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thute na kung ua ka gen ziehin, na lungtang uh lunggimna in na dimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in thutah ka hing hil ahi. Ka peimang ding nou a dingin ahoizaw hi; aziehpen ka peimang sihleh, Hamuonpa na kung uah, ahing pei sih ding hi. Hinanleh ka peimang leh na kung uah Ama ka hing sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ahing tun chiengin, khelna thu ahte, dihtatna thu ahte, tualeh vaihawmna thu ahte, leitung asiemlou dan atheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khelna thu ah siemlou atangsah ding, kei ahing gintat lou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dihtatna thu ah, siemlou atangsah ding, Kei ka Pa kunga pei a, na hing mu nawnlou ding zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaihawmna thu ah, siemlou atangsah ding, tam leitung vaihawmpa thukhen pieh a aum tah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na kung uah thu gen ding tampi ka nei nalai hi, hinanleh tuin na theisiem nai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangtenghitaleh thutah Hagau ahing tun chiengin, thutah zousie ah noute ahing puilut ding; aziehpen Ama thuneina in bangma agen sih dinga, hinanleh azah pouma agen zaw ding hi; tualeh sil hing tung dingte noute ahing hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman kei ahing pahtawi dinga, Keima ate ala dinga, noute ahing hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pa sil nei zousie kei a ahia, Tuaziehin Hagau in Keima ate ala dinga, noute ahing hil ding, kachi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hun tomnoukhat nua chiengin nouten na hing mu nawn sih ding ua, tualeh hun tomnoukhat nua chiengin na hing mukia ding uhi; Pa kunga pei ding ka hizieh in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Anuazuite pawlkhat in, “Hun tomnoukhat nua chiengin nouten na hing mu nawn sih ding ua, tualeh hun tomnoukhat nua chiengin na hing mu kia ding uh, Pa kunga pei ding ka hiziehin, ikunga achi khu bang achina adiei?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun, “Tam athugen, Tomnoukhat nua chiengin, achi bang achina adiei?” Ithei sih uhi, akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama adong nuom uh chi Jesu’n athei a, akung uah, “Hun tomnoukhat nuachiengin na hing mu nawn sih ding ua, tualeh hun tomnoukhat nuachieng in na hing mu kia ding uh, chia ka gen, kidongtuo hi uteh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chitahtah vawt in ka hing hil ahi, noute na kap ding ua, na mau ding uh, hinanleh leitung akipah ding; noute na lunggim ding ua, hinanleh na lunggimna uh kipahna asuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Numei, anau suoh hun atun chiengin, nauvei in gimgentheina athuoh a, hinanleh anau asuoh zou tah chiengin, tua agentheinate aphawh kha nawn sih hi, leitunga mihing khat hing pieng kipahna ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin nouten zong tuin lunggimna na nei uhi, Hinanleh noute ka hing mu kia dinga, na kipah mama ta ding uhi, tualeh na kipahna uh koiman ahing lahpieh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin nouten bangma na hing ngen sih ding uhi. Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, ka min a Pa kunga na nget pouma uh, Aman noute ahing pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tutanin Ka min in bangma na ngen nai sih uh; ngen un na mu ding uh, na kipahna uh abukimna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tam thute na kung uah gentena in ka gen hi; hinanleh gentena thu a na kung ua ka gen nawn louna hun hing tung ding ahita; Pa tungtang thu chientah in ka hing hilta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin ka min in na ngenta ding ua; Noute a dingin, Pa kungah hing nget pieh vang ka china ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen nouten Kei na hing it ua, Pasian akipat a hing pei ka hi chi na gintat zieh un, Pa mama in noute ahing it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei Pa a kipat a hing pawt a, leitunga hing pei ka hi; tualeh leitung nuasie a Pa kunga pei kia ding ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anuazuiten akungah, “Ngai vawi, tuin vang gentethuin na hem gen sih a, kichientahin na genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuin vang Nang bangkim na thei a, koiman ahing doh na kiphamaw sih chi ka theita uhi. Tami zieh in Pasian a kipat a hing pei na hi, chi ka gingta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu’n amaute adawnga, “Tuin na gingta khong khongta u’maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngai un, ahun hing tung ding ahi, tuin zong atungta hi, michin na inn chiet uah na kithethang ding ua, keimatangin na hing nuasie ding uhi, ahivangin Keimatangin ka um sih hi, ka Pa’n ahing umpi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keima a hamuonna na nei theina dingun, tam thute na kung ua ka gen ahi. Leitungah gim gentheina na thuoh ding uhi; hinanleh kipah thanuom in um un, Ken leitung ka zouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thute agen zouin, vanlam ngain adahtou a; “Pa aw ahun atungta, Na Tapa pahtawi in, na Tapa in zong Nang ahing pahtawi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangman Ama kunga na pieh poumate kumtawn hinna apieh theina dinga, mi zousie tunga thuneina na pieh bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tami ahi kumtawn hinna, Nang Pasian dihtah thei leh na sawl Jesu Khrist athei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitungah Na min ka pahtawita, ka bawl dinga na hing pieh nna ka sem zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in Aw Pa, leitung masanga na kunga ka nei, thupinain nangma kung ngel ah hing pahtawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Leitunga kipat a kei nahing piehte kungah, Na min ka theisahta hi; amaute nanga ahi uh, Nang kei na hing pieh ahi, tualeh na thu azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in Kei na hing pieh silte zousie, Nangma hing kipan ahi chi amauten atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen nangman kei kunga thu na hing pieh zousie, ken amaute ka peta a, amaun zong apomta uhi; tualeh nanga kipat a hing pei tahtah ka hi, chi atheita ua, nangma hing sawl ahi chi agingta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute dingin ka ngetpieh hi, leitunga dingin ka ngetpieh sih a, Nangman na hing piehte dingin ka ngetpieh zaw hi; amaute nanga ahi ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ate zousie nanga ahia, Nang ate zousie Kei a ahi, tualeh amauah pahtawi in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in Kei leitungah ka um nawn sih dinga, hinanleh tamte pen leitungah aum ding uhi, kei na kunga hing pei ding ka hita, Pa siengthou aw, eigel pumkhat ihi mabanga, amaute zong pumkhat ahi theina dingun, Nangman na hing piehte Na min in kem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang kei nang piehsa teng toh leitunga ka um khawm sungin na min in amauh ka kem a, Laisiengthou thu atangtun theina dingin, mangthang tapa loungal khatbeeh amangthang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin na kunga hing pei ding ka hita; tualeh ama ua ka kipahna abukim theina dingin, tam silte leitungah ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thu amauh ka peta a, leitungin amauh amuda hi; Kei leitunga ka hilou mabanga amauh zong leitunga ahilou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amauh leitung akipat ladoh dinga hing ngen ka hisih a, hinanleh gitlouna akipat veng dinga ka hing nget ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amauh leitunga ahisih uh, Kei leitunga ka hilou mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thuin amauh susiengthouin; Na thu thutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei leitunga na hing sawl mabangin, ken zong amauh leitungah ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amauh ziehin kei ka kisusiengthou hi, thutah jal a ama u’zong suhsiengthou a a um theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tamte behbeh a dingin ka hing ngen sih a, hinanleh amauh thugenna zieh a, Kei hing gingta dingte a dingin zong ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pa aw, Nang keima ah na um a, Kei nangma a ka um banga, amauh zong eima a pumkhat ahitheina dingun, tualeh Nang kei na hing sawl ahi chi leitungin agintat theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang leh kei pumkhat ihimabangin, amaute zong pumkhat ahing hitheina dingun, nangman kei na hing pieh thupinate, ken amauh ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei ama uah ka um a, Nang keima ah na um hi; tuachi’n amauh pumkhat a suhbukim a aum theina ding un, tualeh Nang kei na hing sawl a, kei na hing it bangin amauh na itta chi leitung in atheina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pa aw, Nang kei na hing piehte zong ka umna a keima toh um a, Nang Kei nang it man a, leitung kisiem masang peha na hing pieh thupina amaun mu u’leh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pa dihtat aw, leitungin Nang ahing theisih a, hinanleh Ken ka hing thei hi, tualeh nang kei na hing sawl hi chi tam miten zong atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh amaute kungah na min ka theisahta a, ka theisah zel ding hi; Kei na hing itna bangbang itna ama ua aum theina leh, kei ama ua ka um theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thute agen zouin anuazuite toh apawtdoh ua, Kidron luita akan ua, tuanah huon khat aum a, tuanah anuazuite toh alut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu lebawl a mansahpa Judas in zong tua mun athei hi, aziehpen tua mun khu Jesu’n anuazuite akimupi zelna mun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judas in siempu liente leh Pharisaite apat in Biehinn veng galkap pawl leh miman lamkaite apui a, thaumeite, meiselte leh hiemleheite tawi in tuanah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu’n atunga sil tung ding zousie theiin ava pei a, akung uah, “Koi ahiei na sui uh?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amauten adawng ua, “Nazareth Jesu” achi uhi, Jesu’n akung uah, “Kei ka hi,” achi hi. Tualeh amansahpa Judas zong akung uah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n “Kei ka hi,” achitahin, akinuatawn ua, tuol ah apuata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n “Koi ahiei na sui uh?” chi’n adong kia a, amaun “Nazareth Jesu” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Kei ama ka hi, chi’n ka hing hilta; Tuaziehin Kei hing sui nahi u’leh tam mite pei sah un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nangman kei na hing piehte khat zong ka mangsah sih hi” chia agen, atangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simon Peter in anamsau kuo adohkhie a, siempulian suohpa asat a, abil zietlam asatkhiet pieh hi. Tua suohpa min khu Malkus ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu’n Peter kungah “Na namsau apai ah sietin, ka pain ahing pieh nou khu dawnlou ding ka hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n biehinn veng galkap pawlte leh lamkai vaisaite leh Judaten Jesu aman ua, akaanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama Annas kungah apeipi masapen uhi, aziehpen ama tuami kum a siempulien apang Kaiapha sungpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam Kaiapha khu, mipite taanga mi khat shi ahoizaw hi, chia Judate kung genpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Simon Peter in Jesu nua azui a, tuamabangin nuazui dang khat in zong azui hi. Tua nuazuipa khu siempulien in amelthei ahia, siempulien inn huong sungah Jesu toh alut khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter khu pulam ah kotpi bul ah ading hi. Nuazui khatpen siempulien meltheipa khu ava pawt a, kotpi ngahnu ahoupi a, Peter a hing puilut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kotpi ngah nungahnu’n Peter kungah, “Nang zong tam mipa nuazuite lah a khat hilou na hiei mah?” achi hi. Aman “Ka hi sih” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh khuo avot ziehin suohte leh inn huong sung veng lamkaiten meihol tawi in akimkot a dingin akisanglum uhi. Tualeh Peter zong amau’toh ding khawm in mei ah akisanglum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempulien in Jesu kungah, anuazuite tungtang leh athuhilna tungtang adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Ken alangtangin leitung thu ka gen a, Judate kikhopna innte leh biehinn ah thu ka hil ngitnget a, asimtham in bangma ka gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangdinga kei hing dong na hiei? Ka thugen zate kung ah dong ve, bangthu ahiei ka gen, amaun athei uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, akunga ding, milien khat in akhut peh in Jesu ngeiphe abehpieh a, “Nang siempulien tambangin na dawng ngam vazuou maw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Thugilou ka gen leh ka gitlouna hing theisah in, hinanleh thudih ka gen leh bangding a nang beh ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Annas in Ama hentomsain siempulien Kaiapha kungah asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simon Peter in dingkawm in mei a awi a, tuaziehin, amaun akung ah, “Nang zong nuazuite lah a khat na hi, na hiei leh?” achi ua, aman theilou khem kipang in “Ka hisih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in abil asatkhietpiehpa sanggam siempulien suohte khat in, “Huon a Ama toh na umkhawm uh ka hing mu ngel hilou amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Peter in akitheimawbawl kia a, tualeh aah akhuong paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Kaiapha inn apat in Jesu khu gam uhpipa thukhenna innpi huong sungah apeipita uhi, tua hun khu zingmawng matah ahi. Hinanleh amaute pen thukhenna innpi huong sung ah alut sih uhi, tuachilouin akisubua kha ding ua, Peikaan annkuong anethei sih kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat akung uah ahing pawtkhie a, “Tam mipa na hehna uh bang ahiei?” chi’n adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amaun adawng ua, “Ama silgilou bawl hisih leh na kungah ka hing pekhe sih ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in akung uah, “Ama peipi unlen, nouma dan toh kituohin atungah thukhenta un,” achi hi. Judaten akungah, “Kou a dingin mi ka thalup ding uh dan ahi sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tami khu bangchibanga shi ding ahiei, chi Jesu mama in agensa atangtun theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat thukhenna inn sung ah alut kia a, Jesu ahan a, akungah, “Judate kumpipa na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Tuakhu nang lungsim a hing suoh a na gen ahiei? ahisihleh midangin ka tungtang thu a ahing hil sawn ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilat in adawnga, “Kei Juda mi ka hiei mah? Na china nampite leh siempulienten nang ka kungah ahing piehkhie uhi; bang na bawla ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Ka leenggam pen tam leitung ahi sih hi. Ka leenggam pen tam leitung toh kisai hitaleh, Judate khuta piehkhiet ka hilouna dingin ka suohte’n adou ding uhi. Hinanleh ka leenggam pen tam leitung ahisih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pilat in akungah; “Ahileh kumpi na hiei leh?” achi hi. Jesu’n adawnga, “Kumpipa nang chi nachi dih hi. Tami ding mawnga pieng ka hi a, tualeh thutah theipi dinga leitunga hing pei ka hi. Koipou thutah a um poumain ka aw aza uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pilat in akungah “Thutah bang ahiei?” achi hi. Aman tam thu agen zouin, Judate kungah ava pawtkhe kia a, akung uah, “Ama ah khelna ka mu sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh peikan pawi hun a henta khat ka hing ha pieh ding ahi chi tawndan khat na nei uhi; tuaziehin Judate kumpipa hing hadoh pieh leng na ut uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n abawnpi un akikou kia ua, “Tam mipa hilouin Baraba ahi nang ha zawh ding,” achi uhi. Baraba pen Suomhat ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in Jesu apui a azepsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh galkapten linglukhu aphan ua, Jesu akhusah ua, tualeh puonsandup asilsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun, “Judate kumpipa salam” chiin akhut un abeng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat ahing pawtkhe kia a, akung uah, “En un, Ama ah dihlouna ka mu sih chi na theina dingun na kung ua ka hing puidoh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu linglukhu khuh leh puonsandup silin ahing pawtdoh a, Pilat in “En un, tam mihingpa! “achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin siempuliente leh biehinn veng lamkaiten ama amu tah un, “Kross ah khailia in, Kross ah khailia in” chiin akikou uhi. Pilat in akung uah “Nouma’n zawpi unlen khailia un, ken Ama dihlouna ka mu sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judaten Ama adawng ua, “Dan khat ka nei ua, Pasian Tapa a akibawl ziehin, ka dan dungzui un shitah ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilat in tam thu a zah tahin azau semsemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh thukhenna innpi sungah ava lut kia a, Jesu kungah, “Hei a hing kipan na hiei?” achi a, hinanleh Jesu’n adawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in akungah, “Ka kunga thu genlou ding na hiei mah? Kross a khailia theina leh hakhiet theina thuneina nei ka hi chi theilou na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, “Tunglam a kipat a pieh hisih lachin ka tungah bangma bawlthei na nei sih ding hi; tuaziehin na kunga hing pekhepa’n khelna alien nei zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khumbansie Pilat in hadoh atum a, hinanleh Judaten “Tam mipa na hadoh leh Kaisar lawm na hi sih ding. Koipou ama leh ama kumpipa a kibawl khu, Kaisar dou ahi,” chi’n akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pilat in tua thu kigen azahtah in Jesu ahing puidoh a, suongleptuoh kichi thukhenna toupha Hebru ham a Gabbatha tungah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ni khu peikan pawi kiginni ahi a, nai guhna hun vel ahi. Tualeh Pilat in Judate kungah, “En un, na kumpipa uh!” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute akikou ua, “Puimangin, puimangin, Kross ah khailia in,” achi uhi. Pilat in akung uah, “Na kumpipa uh maw kross tunga ka khailup ding,” achi hi. Siempulienten “Kaisar loungal kumpipa dang ka nei sih uh,” chi’n adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in Jesu kross tunga killup dingin akung uah apekheta hi. Tuachi’n amaun Jesu ala ua, apuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akross kipuohin Hebru ham a Golgotha kichi lugu mun lam ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuanah Jesu khu kross tungah akilbeh ua midang ni zong agei tuoh ah akilbeh ua, alai ah Jesu akilbeh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilat in ahina lai khat agiel a kross tungah atah hi. Tua alaigel khu, “NAZARETH JESU JUDATE KUMPIPA”, chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam Ahina kigiel Judate tampi in asim uhi, Jesu akilbehna khopi kung nai ahi zieh in. Tualeh tami khu Hebru ham leh Greek ham leh Latin ham a kigiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate siempulienten Pilat kungah “Judate kumpipa chi’n giel sinlen, Judate kumpipa ka hi achi, chiin giel zawin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat in adawnga, “Ka gelsa khu ka gelsa ahita” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu akilbeh zou un, galkapten apuonsilte ala ua, khat chiet a atan dingun phal li asuo uhi, tualeh apuonah zong ala uhi. Apuonah pen akhuina umlou, angawnga pat apum a kigan zom suoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun “Tampen botkeh sih vaiin koipen tan ding ahiei, aisan vai akichi uhi.” Laisiengthouin ka puonsilte akihawm ua, “Ka puontuol a dingin ai asan uh, achi atangtun theina dingin. Tuaziehin galkapten tam silte abawl uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu kros kungah anu leh anu sanggamnu, Kleopa zi Mari leh Mari Magdalene ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu’n anu leh anuazui a itpa akunga ding amu tahin, anu kungah “Numei en in na tapa!” achi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuipa kungah, “En in na nu!” achi hi. Tua huna kipat in nuazuipa’n amanu a inn ah apuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zouin Jesu’n sil zousie tuin bawl zousieng ahita chi thei in Laisiengthou thugen a tangtunna dingin, “Ka dang atah” achi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua mun ah greptui thua a dim bel khat akitung hi, amaun tua greptui-thua ah tuihupna khat adie ua hissop chiengkang dawn ah ata ua, Akam toh asutuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n greptui thua adawn zouin, “Zaw ahita,” achi a, alu akunsuh a, ahagau ahata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua ni khu kiginni ahi ziehin, Judaten aluongte uh khawlni a kros dawn a aumden ding uh adei sih ua, aziehpen tua khawlni khu ni thupitah hi ding ahita hi, tuaziehin Judaten Pilat kungah akengte uh sat tawng pieh a, aluong uh ladoh dingin, angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkapte ahing pei ua, Jesu toh kikilbeh atuoh masahpen uh kengte leh khatpen kengte asat tawng pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu kung ahing tun un, Ama ana shi zoute chi amu ua, akengte asat tawng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh galkapte lah a khat in, teipiin anah asun a, sisan leh tui ahing luongkhe pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh tami mupa’n atheipita a, atheipina khu adih ahi. Tualeh nouten na gintat theina ding un agen dih ahi, chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aziehpen Laisiengthou in, “Agu khat zong sattawng ahi sih ding achi tangtun na dingin tam silte ahing umta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Laisiengthou sung mun dang ah, “Amaun asutpa uh a en ding uh, chiin akigiel kia hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tamte nua in Arimathai khomi, Judate agiin zieh a aguh a Jesu nuazui Joseph in Jesu luong alah theina dingin Pilat kungah ava ngen hi. Pilat in phalna apie a, tuachi’n ama ahing pei a Jesu luong ala ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh tumasanga zanlai a Jesu kunga hing hawpa Nikodem zong ahing pei a murrah leh aloe kihal gimnamtui agihdan pound zakhat vel ahing tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Jesu luong ala ua, Judate kivui ngaina dan bangin gimnamtui toh puonnem in atuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh kross a akilbehna mun uah huon khat a um a, tua huon ah, koima kivui ngai louna han tha khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judate kiginni ahiziehin, tua han ah Jesu asielta uhi, han khu nainoukhat ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nipikal khat a ni masapen zingmawng khuo miel nalai in Mari Magdalene han ah ava haw a, tua hankot kisinna suong kilakhesa in amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu ataipai vingveng a Simon Peter leh nuazui dang Jesu’n a itpa kungah, “Hankhuh akipat in Mangpa luong alamangta uhi, heisung a asiel uh ahiei ka thei sih uhi,” avachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Peter apawtdoh a, tualeh nuazui dangpen zong, tualeh han lam azuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ani un ataikhawm ua, nuazui dang khat penin Peter amakhel a, han atung masa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman kunsuh in hankhuh sung a en a, dielpuonnem kipha khu amu a, hinanleh hankhuh sung ah alut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simon Peter zong ama nua ah ahing tunga, hankhuh sungah alut a, dielpuonnem umte amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu lutang tuomna puon pen dielpuonnem toh umkhawm lou a, atuom a mun khat a kiziela um amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua nuazui dang khat han a tung masapa zong asungah alut a, amu a, agingta ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun Jesu mishi lah a kipat in athou kia ding ahi chi, Laisiengthou thu athei nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuite amauh inn lam chiet ah anua pei kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Mari khu han pulam ah kap in ading a, tualeh kap kawmin akuun a han sung a en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu luong kisielna mun ah vansawlsieng ni, aluhung lam ah khat, akenghuontaw lam ah khat, puon vam sil a tou amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua vansawlsiengten akungah, “Numei bang dinga kap na hiei?” achi uhi. Amanu’n akung uah, “Ka Mangpa alamangta ua, hei a asiel uh ahiei chi ka theilou ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam thu genkawma akinuahei leh tuana Jesu ding amu hi. Hinanleh Jesu ahi chi athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Numei bangding a kap na hiei? Koi ahiei na sui?” achi hi. Amanu’n huon bawlpa hiva achi ziehin, “Pu aw Ama na puohkhiet ahileh, na sielna hing hilin, tuachi’n ken. Ama ka lakhe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Mari” achi a, amanu akihei a, akungah “Rabboni” achi hi. Tua pen Siepa china ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Hing tuden sin, ka Pa kungah ka peitou nai sih hi. Hinanleh ka sanggamte kungah va pei inlen, akung uah, Ka Pa, na pa uh, tualeh ka Pasian na Pasian uh kunga peitou ding ka hita chi’n va gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mari Magdalene ahing pei a, nuazuite kungah, “Mangpa amu” thu leh tam silte ama’n akungah agen hi, chi amaute kungah ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuani mama nipi kaalkhat a ni masapen nitahlam in, nuazuite mun khat ah aumkhawm ua, Judate agiin zieh ua, kot kikhakhum uh hinapi, Jesu ahing pei a alah uah ahing ding a, akung uah, “Na tung uah hamuonna um hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, akhutte leh anah amaute ala hi. Nuazuiten Mangpa amu tahun akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Na tung uah lungmuonna um hen; Ka Pa’n ahing sawl mabangin noute ka hing sawl hi,” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin atung uah ahu ahakhum a “Hagau Siengthou tangta un achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi koipou khelna na ngaidam u’leh, ngaidam ahi ding a, mi koipou khelnate na ngaidam sih u’leh ngaidam lou ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Thomas didum kichipa nuazui sawm leh nite lah a khat, Jesu hing pei lai in alah uah a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin nuazui dangten akungah, “Mangpa ka muta uh” achi uhi. Hinanleh ama’n akung uah, “Akhut a siakilna pawnte ka mu a, siakilna pawnte sunga ka khutme ka guon vateh a, tualeh anah ka khut a ka tham vateh sih leh ka gingta sih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh ni giet nua in nuazuite inn sungah aum kia ua, Thomas zong alah uah a um hi. Kotte kikil hinapi Jesu ahing pei a, alah uah adinga “Na tung uah Hamuonna um hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n Thomas kungah, “Na khutme in hing tham inlen, ka khutte en in. Na khut in ka nah tham inlen sawhin. Ginglel nawn sinlen, gingta tain,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thomas in adawnga akungah, “Ka Mangpa leh ka Pasian aw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Thomas nang kei na hing mu ziehin na gingta ahi, mulou a gingtate ahampha uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Adihtahin Jesu’n anuazuite mitmu a chiemtena dang tampi abawlte tam laibu a kigiel lou a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh tamte pen nouten Jesu Khrist Pasian Tapa ahi chi na gintat na ding u’leh, na gintat zieh ua amina hinna na nei na ding ua kigiel ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nuain Jesu Tiberia diilah, anuazuite kungah akilah kia a, tambangin akilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simon Peter toh, Didum kichi Thomas toh, Galili gam a Kana khuo a um Nathanael toh, Zebedi tapate toh, tualeh anuazui dang ni toh, umkhawm ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simon Peter in akung uah, “Ngaman a kuon ding ka hi,” achi hi. Amauten akungah, “Kouzong hing haw va ung,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n akuonkhie ua, kuong sungkhat ah atou pai ua, hinanleh tuami zan in bangma aman sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh zingmawng ahing hitah in, Jesu diilpieu ah a ding a, hinanleh nuazuiten Jesu ahilam athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Naute aw, nga khatbeh manlou na hi uoi mah?” achi hi. Amaun “Manlou” chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Kuong gei zietlam pangah na len uh sep un, them khat na man ding uhi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaun asep ua, tuachi’n nga atamseng ziehin akaidohzou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jesu’n a it nuazuipa’n Peter kungah, “Mangpa lah ahi’n,” achi hi. Simon Peter in Mangpa ahi chi azah tahin apuonah tungnung asil zuai a (guohtanga um ahi ziehin) tui lah ah atawmkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh nuazui dangten len a ngate kaikawmin kuong neu khat in ahing pei ua, aziehpen tuipi pieu gei gamla lou tong zani vel a um ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh pieu gaw ahing tun tah un, meihol kitaw kuong leh atunga nga leh tanghou kikoi amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Na nga matte uh themkhat hing tawi vawi un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Simon Peter khu apeitou a, nga lienpipi za leh sawmnga leh thum dim len khu pieu gei ah ahing kaidoh hi tuabang khopin nga tam nanleh len akeh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Hing pei unlen zing ann hing ne un” achi hi. Hinanleh nuazuite koiman, “Nang koi na hiei?” achi ngam sih uhi, Mangpa ahi chi athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu ahing pei a tanghou ala a, akung uah apie a tuamabangin nga zong apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam pen Jesu shina akipat athawkia nua a, anuazuite kunga akilah thum veina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n a zing ann neh zou un, Jesu’n Simon Peter kungah, “Simon Johan tapa, tamte sangin kei nang it zaw ei?” achi hi. Aman akungah, “Hi Mangpa ka hing it chi na thei hi,” achi hi. Jesu’n akungah “Ka belamnoute vah in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu’n ani veina dingin akungah “Johan tapa Simon, Kei nang it ei?” achi kia hi. Aman akungah, “Hi, Mangpa ka hing it chi na thei hi,” achi hi. Jesu’n akungah “Ka belamte ching in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu’n athumveina dingin, “Simon Johan tapa Nang kei nang it ei?” achi hi. Jesu’n akunga thumvei tah, “Nang kei na hing it ei” achi ziehin Peter alunggim hi. Tuachi’n Peter in akungah “Mangpa nang sil zousie na thei a; Ka hing it hi chi na thei hi,” achi hi. Jesu’n akungah, “Ka belamte vaa in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hinghil a hi, na naupan lai in na kawng nangma’n na kigah a, na utna lamlam ah na kivah kawi hi; hinanleh na hing upat chiengin na khut na zah dinga, midangten na kawng ahing gahpieh dinga, na utlouna lamlam ah ahing kai ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thu agen pen, Peter in bangchibang shina thuoh a Pasian apahtawi ding ahiei, chi agenna ahi. Jesu’n tam thute agen zouin akungah “Kei hing zui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter akinuahei leh Jesu’n nuazui a itpa, nitah ann neh lai a, a anga kingam a “Mangpa koi ahiei Nang hing mansah ding?” chipain hing zuiin amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Peter in amapa amu tah in Jesu kungah, “Mangpa tam mipa’n bang abawl diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Ka hing pei masangsie dam a umden dingin dei leng, nang bang phatmawna a um ei? Nang hing zui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam nuazuipa khu shilou ding ahi chiin unaute lah ah tam thu kigen akithangta hi, Jesu’n lah ama ashi sih ding achi sih a, “Ama ka hing pei masangsie dam a umden dingin dei leng, nang bang phatmawna a um ei,” achi ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam silte theisahpa leh tam thute gielpa khu tam nuazuipa ahi, tualeh athu theisah khu adih ahi chi ithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n abawl sil lamdang tampi zong a um nalai hi, tuate gelkim sieng ding hileh laibu kigiel dingte khu leitung pumpi in zong dawl zou dingin ka gingta sih hi. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
